<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Zul</book>
  <para style="h">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zo shirəm kan Matiyu rəsh gwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Zo Shirəm kan</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Rəsh gwa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Tǝlankur kǝ shirǝm den gǝs kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Mǝnkǝn ni'e tǝlankur kǝ gǝs kǝ Yesu Almasihu gǝsgal kǝ Dauda, muntu kan gǝsgal kǝ Ibǝrahim ni gwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibǝrahim ni'e basi Ishaku, Ishaku ni'e basi Yakubu, Yakubu ni'e basi Yahuda na mir ezǝni. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yahuda ni'e basi Peres na Zera. Nazin ni'e Tamar. Peres ni'e basi Hezron, Hezron ni'e basi Aram. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Aram ni'e basi Aminadab, Aminadab ni'e basi Nashon, Nashon ni'e basi Salmon, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon ni'e basi Bo'az. Nas ni'e Rahab. Bo'az ni'e basi Obed, muntu nas ni'e Rut gwa, kan Obed ni'e basi Yesse. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yesse ni'e basi gun Dauda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Dauda ni'e basi Solomon, muntu kan nas ni'e Batsheba kan faro gǝr kǝ Uriya ni gwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomon ni'e basi Rehobowam, Rehobowam ni'e basi Abiya kan Abiya ni'e basi Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa ni'e basi Yehoshapat. Yehoshapat ni'e basi Yoram, kan Yoram ni'e basi Uzziya. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzziya ni'e basi Yotam. Yotam ni'e basi Ahas kan Ahas ni'e basi Hezikiya. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezikiya ni'e basi Manasse, Manasse ni'e basi Amon, kan Amon ni'e basi Yosiya. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosiya ni'e basi Yekoniya na mir mǝn gǝpi gǝs kan dǝm zher wokoci tu yem wur su Babila kagwa.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Den kaar kǝ yemi gǝzǝn zher su Babila kawo, Yekoniya dǝm basi Sheyaltiyel, Sheyaltiyel ni'e basi Zerubabel. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabel ni'e basi Abihud, Abihud ni'e basi Eliyakim kan Eliyakim ni'e basi Azor. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azor ni'e basi Zadok, Zadok ngapo basi Akim ni kan Akim ni'e basi Eliyud. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyud ni'e basi Eleyazar. Eleyazar ni'e basi Mattan kan Mattan eso basi Yakubu ni. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Kano Yakubu ni'e basi Isubu ba kos kǝ Maryamu muntu kan gǝr Yesu kan ba la ti bi'e Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Mǝngǝri ra den mǝngǝri kutl cet wupse argon tu pǝn den Ibǝrahim ar ri den gǝri kǝ Dauda gwa. Mǝngǝri ra den mǝngǝri kutl cet wupse es argon tu pǝn den Dauda ba ri wokoci tu yem mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila wu dǝm zher gip atl kǝ Babila gwa. Eso, mǝngǝri ra den mǝngǝri kutl cet wupse argon tu pǝn den dǝmi zher su Babilaka ar ba ri den Almasihu gwa.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gǝri kǝ Yesu Almasihu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Nankǝn ni gǝri kǝ Yesu Almasihu ra. Wokoci tu Maryamu ra na o gam dati kǝ gudlumi na Isubuwo, tǝ dǝm gǝr gǝs wu da'a, ar ni shin tǝ ra na tu gǝri muntu tǝ zam tǝp kar Ruhu kǝ Yam gwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Isubu nye kos gǝsiwo, mǝn pitǝn dlat ni. Tǝ ndu ɗǝli shirǝmika kari da'a bǝse tǝ la ti gip sham kar mbarǝme. Ar ni tǝ pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝs'e tii za tǝka shok.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ama nan tǝ den damtǝn denewo, ar ni nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Babom Yam ɗǝl kar ti gip tlon tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Isubu gǝsgal kǝ Dauda ba kǝ kum bǝrti kǝ pǝni Maryamu tǝ dǝm gǝr gi da'a. Pǝni tu gǝs tuwo tǝp kar Ruhu kǝ Yam ni. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Tii gǝr nya, kan kǝ ne ti sun'e Yesu, domici tin tii ɗǝli mbarǝm gǝska gip warwat pitǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Muntu kup pini kǝ dǝ laa'i argon tu Babom Yam yari tǝp kar mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa'e, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Nye gǝr mǝn yap gam baa zam tu'e, tǝ gǝr nya moni, baa la ti bi'e Imanuel.&gt;&gt; Gǝs kǝ sunyi'e, &lt;&lt;Yam ra nan mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Nan Isubu putuwo, ar ni tǝ pi kandatu nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami yari ti gwa, tǝ pǝn Maryamu tǝ dǝm gǝr gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Ama tǝ mom ti nya mǝtliyi da'a, har tǝ gǝr nya gǝsi. Kan Isubu ba ne ti sun'e Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Cwattǝn kǝ mǝn momi zǝnges tor gabǝs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Den kaar kǝ gǝri Yesu gip bǝn Betelehem gip kǝti atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda, wokoci tu Hiridus ra den dandi gwawo, ar ni mǝn momi zǝnges jen tli tor gabǝs wu sur bǝn kǝ Urshalima. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Wu ngen momi, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni pel gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda tu kan'i gǝr ti gwa ra? Domici mǝ shin zǝnges gǝs su gabǝska ar ni mǝ tor kǝ dǝ mǝ bote ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Nan gun Hiridus kum untuwo, ar ghun ti naari nan ti na mbarǝm kǝ Urshalima kup. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Kan tǝ dom kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa kup, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa, kan tǝ ngen momi las tu baa gǝr Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;gip Betelehem ni kan ra gip kǝti atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa, domici untun mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam rǝsh'e, <verse eid="MAT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />&lt;Ki Betelehem kan ra gip kǝti atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa, ba'e ki ni kǝ mani kaltǝn gip mir bǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda da'a. Fawo gip ki ni baa gǝr bar mǝn kopi na mbarǝme, muntu baa le mbarǝm gǝn kǝ Isra'ila wule tǝm gwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ar ni Hiridus la bi mǝn momi zǝnges ju muri, tǝ ngen momi wokoci tu zǝngesi ɗǝl gwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Kan tǝ kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Te ni gip bǝn Betelehem, kǝ ngen ni gǝs kǝ nyayi hoyi. Kǝn ni kǝ zam tiwo, kǝ ter yarim ni, ami ma a te bote ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Nan wu kum shirǝm kǝ gunyiwo, ar ni wu ndara. Ar ni zǝnges tu kan wu shin su gabǝs ka gwa ba nde wur cina ar ba ri dlǝr sur gam las tu kan nyayi ra gwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Nan wu shin zǝngesiwo, ar ni wu pi ghol mbatl hoyi. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Nan wu te gip bomiwo, kan wu shin nyayi na nas Maryamu, ar ni wu ngus cina da ti wu bote ti. Kano wu ɓul posh gǝzǝn wu bi ti bari; ga zǝnariya, na lubban, na mur, munjuwo mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝr ni kǝ keri, na kǝ bǝrketǝne. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Nan dǝli wur kǝm gip tlon den ba dǝ wu'i pal tǝp kar gun Hiridus dawo, ar ni wu kop zut tǝp gon wu pal rǝn atl gǝzǝnka.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isubu na Maryamu kǝtǝr gǝzǝn su Masarka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Nan ga mǝn momi bari ndarawo, ar ni nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Babom Yam gon ɗǝl kar Isubu gip tlone. Tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyam kǝ pǝn nyayi na nas kǝ kǝtǝr ni gin te atl kǝ Masarka, kǝ dǝm ni teka, se ami ni a yari in'e dǝ kǝ pal ter gwa, domici Hiridus den ngeni nyayi kǝ dǝ tǝ ri ti eka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Ar ni Isubu tlyam kan tǝ pǝn nyayi na nas gip gasi, tǝ ndara Masar. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Tǝ dǝm teka ba ri kaar kǝ mǝshtǝn kǝ Hiridus. Muntu pi ni kǝ dǝ laa'i argon tu Babom yari tǝp bi dǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Ter Masar ni a la bi nya gǝni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11.1</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ri mimir mir moni eka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Nan Hiridus shin mǝn momi zǝnges ju pali tǝka kǝdlǝmiwo, ar ni lo ci ti naar kan tǝ kar bar dǝ ri kup mimir moni munju ra gip bǝn Betelehem na kosack kǝ bǝni gwa eka, munju ri sheti ghon rop na munju ri untu wu dagwa. Tǝ pǝn ni kǝ pi untu den wokoci tu mǝn momi zǝnges ju yari ti shirǝm den nyayi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Wokociyi ni shirǝm kǝ Irmiya, mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam laa'i'e,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />&lt;&lt;Kum yar gon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">gip bǝn kǝ Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">yar kulu na dun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">mbatl mǝn nartǝni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahila ni den kulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">den mimir gǝsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Tǝ nge kumi dǝ iɗa'i ti mbatlka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">domici wu'i da'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Iri 31.15</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paltǝn Nazarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Nan Hiridus mǝshkawo, ar ni mǝn kartǝn kǝ Babom Yam gon ɗǝl kar Isubu gip tlon te Masarka, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyami, kǝ pǝn nyayi na nas kǝ pal ni te gip kǝti atl kǝ Isra'ilaka, domici munju ba ngen ri nyeyi ekawo wu mǝsh kawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ar ni tǝ tlyam kan tǝ pǝn nyayi na nas wu pal te atl kǝ Isra'ilaka. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ama nan tǝ kum'e Arkilawus ni pal den dandi kǝ bas Hiridus mǝn lish kǝ Yahudiyawo, ar ni bǝrti ci ti kǝ tetǝn lasi. Ama nan dǝli tǝ kǝm gip tlono, ar ni tǝ rat gǝs gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Kan tǝ te dǝm gip bǝn gon kan ba wul ti'e Nazarat gwa, den bi yari kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam'e, &lt;&lt;Baa la ti bi'e, Ba mǝn Nazarat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">La'i icin kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Gip muri ja ni Yohana mǝn pi batisma ɗiri, tǝ den wazu shirǝm kǝ Yam gip kǝti atl kǝ mǝn Yahuda, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />tǝ den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ci ni atl gam kǝ pal ni kar Yami, domici mulki kǝ Yam mbira kosak wi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Muntu ni'e mbarǝm tu kan Ishaya mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam shirǝm den ti gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;&lt;Yar kǝ gon mǝn latǝn bi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">gip lǝp den wultǝn'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;Kǝrkǝmi ni Babom guntǝp</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">kǝ cwattǝn gǝsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">dǝ guntǝp gǝs dǝm na ta'i.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Tutul dli ka ta rakumi ni Yohana la'i, tǝ dlǝmat ti na late. Fingal gǝs ni'e zas na domi. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Mbarǝm kǝ bǝn kǝ Urshalima na kǝ mǝn kǝti atl kǝ Yahudiya na mǝn atl kǝ bi ɓula Urdun pi ta ɗirtǝn kar ti. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Wu ɗir gip dlom mbarǝm wu yari warwat pitǝn gǝzǝni, kan tǝ pi wur batisma gip ɓula kǝ Urdun.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Nan tǝ shin mǝn Parise na mǝn Sadukiya na womti den ɗirtən kǝ dǝ pi wur batismawo. Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ga badǝr kǝ wonzi! Woni dǝli in kǝm kǝ dǝ kǝ kǝtǝri ni lo kǝ Yam mǝn ɗirtǝn we? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Pi ni mbap tu kan baa gode ci atl gam na paltǝn gin kar Yam gwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Ba kǝ ɓo ni ngetl den'e, &lt;Ibǝrahim ni'e be gin da'a.&gt; A yari ine, Yam baa mani pi Ibǝrahim mimir na tat ju. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Tare ne bi ndal den gǝs kin wi. Kin tu kup kan gǝri ho mimir dawo, baa wotl tika dǝ la ti te utuka.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Amiwo, a pi in ni batisma na mal kǝ dǝ gode'e kǝ ci atl gam kǝ pal kar Yam wi. Ama gon ra den ɗirtǝn kaar dami kan manǝm nartǝn gwa, muntu kan kaptǝlan gǝs ma a kǝm pǝni da'a. Tii pi in batisma na Ruhu kǝ Yam na utu. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Gal bǝtke bar gǝs ra am dati, tii sar ba desi bar gǝska hoyi, tǝ dom gesi o tǝ wi ɓindika, kan kǝptiyi ngapo tǝ kerika gip utu tu kan baa mǝsh dagwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pi Yesu batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Wokociyi ni Yesu ɗəl ɗir gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili, tǝ mbubar ɓula Urdun, kǝ dǝ Yohana pi ti batisma. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Yohana ndu tǝ nge gǝsi, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami kan a ndu'e kǝ pim batismawo, kǝ pa ɗir karim esa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Naa ar dǝm untu kǝkǝni, domici untu ni ar ndari mǝ laa'i argon tu kup dlat ni ar ra kar Yam gwa.&gt;&gt; Na untu ni Yohana nǝmi ti.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Nan pi Yesu batisma tǝ ɗǝl tor gip maliwo, ar ni yam ɓuli, kan tǝ shin Ruhu kǝ Yam den surtǝn wule kuɓuri tǝ sur dlǝr den bibyala gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Kan ba kum yar ɗǝl sur yam ba wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu ni'e Nya gǝni. A ndu ti, kan tǝ gholim mbatl naari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Godetǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mar 1.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ar ni Ruhu kǝ Yam ri Yesu gip lǝpe, kǝ dǝ Shetan mǝn setǝn gode ti. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Nan tǝ pi guzum mal muri hauya rop (40) pǝt na gasi, den kariwo, guzum ci ti. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Ar ni mǝn setǝni ɗir tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;O ki Nya Yamno, wul tat ju'e wu dǝm bǝredi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Ama Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam'e, &lt;Na bǝredi ni katl mbarǝm ba mani dǝmi da'a, ama na ko gonge shirǝm kan ba ɗǝl kar Yam gwa ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">TTS 8.3</ref>.</char></note>&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Ar ni mǝn setǝni si ti bǝn Urshalima, bǝn tu kan Yam zǝzari gam gǝs gwa, tǝ te ti to den gam bom kǝ Yamka kan to yam naar gwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;O ki Nya Yam no, ɓo tuma su atlka. Domici Shirǝm kǝ Yam wule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">&lt;Tii bi bi dǝ mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">den wu gaa ki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">bǝse kǝ ɓo asǝmka den tate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Zab 91.11-12</ref>.</char></note>&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ra na rǝshi es'e, &lt;Kii gode Babom Yam gi da'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">TTS 6.16</ref>.</char></note>&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Den kaariwo, ar ni mǝn setǝni te Yesu den gam tlyari tlǝndǝre, tǝ ta'i ti am den mulki kǝ atl kup na nartǝn gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Aa bi'i mulki kǝ atl ju kup, ki ni kǝ nda atl cina da'ǝm kǝ botem gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tli karǝmka, Shetan! Domici ar ra na rǝshi'e, &lt;Bote Babom Yam gi nan gǝsi. Ti ni katl kii bote ti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">TTS 6.13</ref>.</char></note>&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ar ni mǝn setǝni za ti. Kan mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ba cwat kar ti, wu pi ti mbapi.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pare pi mbap gǝs gip Galili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mar 1.14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luk 4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Nan Yesu kum'e la Yohana ka gip bom kǝ moni wo, ar ni tǝ ndara kǝti atl kǝ Galili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Kan tǝ za bǝn Nazarat, tǝ te Kaparnahum na dǝmi, te bi bar ɓulaka, las tu kan kǝ Zebulun na Naftali ni gwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zabuluna na Naftaliwo mimir kǝ Yakubu ni. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Kǝ dǝ laa'i argon tu Ishaya mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam yari gwa'e,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />&lt;&lt;Ki las kǝ Zebulun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">na las kǝ Naftali kan ra gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">kǝti atl kǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">kǝti atl tu kan kop bi bar ɓula gwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">na markǝm bar ɓula'i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">ar ba su jikat ɓula Urdun gwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Munju ba dǝm gip dǝmǝn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">shin bar cirtǝn wi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Mǝn dǝmi gip dǝmǝn atl kǝ mǝshtǝno, cirtǝn cwati wur wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Tun wokoci ta ni Yesu pare la'i icin shirǝm kǝ Yam tǝ den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Cini atl gam kǝ pal ni kar Yami, domici mulki kǝ Yam mbira kosak wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la bi mǝn nǝmi kos mbarǝm wupse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Nan tǝ den kopi bi bar ɓula Galiliwo, ar ni tǝ shin mbarǝm rop, Simon kan ba la ti bi'e Bitǝrus gwa na erǝm gǝs Andǝrawus. Tǝ zam wur den la'i bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝn gip mal bar ɓula'i domici wi mǝn nǝmi kos ni. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝn ni, aa pali in mǝn ɗiri mbarǝm karǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Na zhotǝne, ar ni wu za bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝnka, kan wu kop ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Nan tə te cinawo, ar ni tǝ pa shin mbarǝm rop, wu ma mǝn gǝpi na mǝn bari ni, Yakubu nya Zabadi na erǝm gǝs Yohana. Tǝ zam wur gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal na bazin Zabadi, wu den kǝrkǝm bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝni. Kan tǝ la wur bi. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Ar ni wu za kungǝlǝn jikat mali kup na bazini, kan wu kop ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne am mbarǝm ra na womti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu kop kup gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili, tǝ den kulci gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. Tǝ den la'i icin kǝ zo shirǝm dǝmi kǝ Yam gunye, na pǝni kumi dli kǝ ko gonge ciwo kǝ mbarǝme. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Na untu ni shirǝm den ti ri gip atl kǝ Siriya kup. Na untu ni pi ta ɗiri ti mǝn kumi dli kup, mǝn patǝn na ko gonge ciwo, na mǝn dun itǝri, na mǝn ndetǝn atli, na munju itǝr tle wur dlika gwa. Tǝ warke wur kup. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Ar ni mbarǝm na womti gip kǝti atl kǝ Galili, na kǝta atl kǝ Dikapolis (mir bǝn kutl ituwi), na bǝn Urshalima, na kǝti las kǝ mǝn Yahuda, na kǝti las kǝ te bi ɓula Urdun ka kop ti.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Kulci kǝ Yesu den tlǝndǝre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Nan Yesu shin mbarǝm dom wur na womtiwo, ar ni tǝ to gǝs den gam tlǝndǝre. Nan tǝ dǝmo, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti to kar ti. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Ar ni tǝ kulci wur tǝ wule.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Albarka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />&lt;&lt;Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e munju kan mom na ɗattǝn gǝzǝn gip ruhu gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">Mulki kǝ Yamo gwazin ni.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e munju ra na dun mbatl gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">Yam baa iɗa'i wur mbatli.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e munju kan pali gam gǝzǝnka atli gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">Atl kundǝrǝndlip baa dǝm gwazini.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e munju ba kum guzum na lam pi argon tu kan dlat ni ar ra gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">Yam baa laa'i wur tu na argon tu wu ndu gwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e munju ra na guna ger gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">Yam baa kum guna gǝzǝni.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e munju mbatl gǝzǝn ra ngǝlan gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">Wi shin Yami.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e mǝn sitin gip dlom kǝ ɗiri dǝmi zhǝlili.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">Baa la wur bi mimir kǝ Yami.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Mǝn ghol mbatl ni'e munju kan ba kumi wur dli den bi pitǝn dlat gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">Mulki kǝ Yamo gwazin ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />&lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn ghol mbatl ni wokoci tu mbarǝm ba zage ine, wu kumi in dli, wu pa ne in ko gonge ɗasi tu te gamka den kǝn mǝn kopi gǝn ni gwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Untu ni wu kumi dli ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam munju kan ra kapǝn kǝn gwa. Gyatl ni kǝ pi ni ghol mbatl na naari, domici argon tu Yam baa bi in to yamkawo ar naari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den Mas na cirtǝni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />&lt;&lt;Kǝn nǝra wule mas gip atl kundǝrǝndlip. Mas ni njulkawo, na unun ba pali tǝmtǝn gǝs we? Ar i na mbap kǝ pi da'a, se dǝ shotika, dǝ mbarǝm desika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />&lt;&lt;Kǝn nǝra wule cirtǝn kar mbarǝm den kaar atli. Bǝn tu kan tu to den tudu kawo, ba mani ghundǝr gǝska da'a. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Ba mbǝsh utu gip pitila kan dǝ zup ka na bar gal da'a. Ama ba ne ti ni den ba dǝmi gǝsi, kan ar bi mbarǝm kǝ bomi kup cirtǝni. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Untu ma, za ni dǝ cirtǝn gin cir cina dǝ mbarǝme, kǝ dǝ wu shin mbuni mbap gin ra, arni wi ɗǝɗa Ba gin kǝ to yamka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den kulci kǝ Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />&lt;&lt;Ba kǝ pǝn ni den a sur ni kǝ dǝ a pika na kulci kǝ Musa, ko rǝshi kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam da'a. A sur ni kǝ dǝ a pa'ika nan wur da'a, ama kǝ dǝ a laa'i wur ni. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari in'e, yam na atl baa paka, ama ko nye njem ko ɗigo gon ra da'a gip Kulci kǝ Musa kan ba pika nari kapǝn dǝ ko unu pi kandatu Kulciyi wule ar baa pi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ra'untuwo, kup muntu kan cen nǝm gip Kulci ju ka, kan tǝ pa kulci jen wu cen Kulciyi ka pa'o, baa wul ti'e kali gip mulki kǝ Yami. Ngapo, kup muntu kan kop Kulciyi, kan tǝ kulci jeno, baa wul ti'e mǝn nartǝn gip mulki kǝ Yami. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />A yari in'e, pitǝn dlat gin ni man kǝ me gam kǝ Parise na mǝn kulci den Kulci kǝ Musa dawo, ki te gip mulki kǝ Yam da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci kǝ Yesu den pi lo'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ kum yari ga kori gǝmi terka'e, &lt;Ba kǝ rini gon eka da'a. Muntu ri gon ekawo, ba hukunte ti.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ama a yari ine, kup muntu ba pi lo na esi ma, baa hukunte ti. Muntu es wul esi'e wop mbarǝmo, baa ri ti cina dǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmi. Eso, muntu wul esi'e kǝdlǝmo, tǝ ndar tetǝn gip utu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Ra untuwo, kini den bi Yam bar den bagadi sadakawo, kan kǝ dam ki den gon ra nan ki su mbatlkawo, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />za ari bi bagadiyi kakani, kǝ ri kǝrkǝm dlom gin na ya'iyi, kan kǝ'i bi Yam bar giyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />&lt;&lt;Zho'i kǝ ci atl gam na muntu kan ra na shirǝm den ki gwa, kapǝn dǝ ri'i cina dǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmi. Kini kǝ pi untu dawo, ti la ki am dǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmi, kan dǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm byal ki am dǝ dogari, kan dǝ la ki gip bom kǝ moni. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari'i, ki ɗǝl gip bom kǝ moniyi da'a, se kini kǝ ɓatl argon tu ba kop ki kup gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci kǝ Yesu den muri na mǝtli ko moni kaari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ kum yari in'e, &lt;Ba kǝ mur ni na mǝtli ko moni kaari da'a.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ama a yari ine, muntu kup shin gǝr mǝtli, shintǝn kǝ ndutǝn kǝ ci mbatlo, ya mur nan ti gip mbatl gǝs ituwi. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ger gǝ kǝ shimli ni ba kem ki kǝ pi warwat pitǝno, ɗǝli kǝ laka. Ar ba mani'i dǝ kǝti kǝ dli gi gon liika, na dǝ la dli gi kup te gip utuka. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Am gi kǝ shimli ni ba kem ki kǝ pi warwat pitǝno, tlo kǝ laka. Ar ba mani'i dǝ kǝti kǝ dli gi gon liika, na dǝ la dli gi kup te gip utuka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci kǝ Yesu den kari gǝrka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mar 10.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Yari es'e, &lt;Kup muntu baa kar gǝr gǝskawo, ar nǝm tǝ bi gǝri tǝlankur kǝ kartǝnka.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ama argon tu a yari ino arni'e, muntu kup kar gǝr gǝska, ba'e den tǝp kǝ muri na moni kari ni dawo, tǝ kem ti kǝ muri na moni kaari ituwi. Muntu kup gudlumi na gǝr tu kan karkawo, tǝ dǝm mǝn muri na mǝtli kaari ituwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den ɓe am atli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ kum yari ga kori gǝmi terka'e, &lt;Ba kǝ ɓo am atl na atl ko na yam den lar da'a, se de kǝ ɓatl argon tu kǝ pǝni gam gi ki bi Babom gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ama a yari ine, ba kǝ ɓoni am atl na atli ko na yam dama, domici to yamka ni'e dandi kǝ Yami. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Ba kǝ ɓo am atli na atl da'a, domici atl ni'e ba ne asǝm gǝsi, ko na bǝn Urshalima domici arni'e bar bǝn kǝ Bar Gunye. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ba kǝ ɓo ngetl na gam gi da'a, domici ki mani pali ta gam gi gon dunyi ko gholi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Kup argon tu ki yariwo, ar dlǝr den &lt;Aan&gt; ko &lt;o'o.&gt; Ar ni man untuwo kar Mǝn ɗasi tu ni ɗǝli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den pǝni pansa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29">Luk 6.29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ kum yari terka'e, &lt;ger den am kǝ ger ni, shin ngapo den am kǝ shin ni.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kulci kǝ Musa yari'e, argon tu baa hukunte mbarǝm denewo ar ɗir nǝm na argon tu mǝri pi gwa. Zhit muntu gip Ɗǝltǝne 21.24, Livitikus 19.18; 24.20, Bi Doka kǝ rop 19.21</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ama a yari in'e bakǝ nge ni mbarǝm mǝn ɗasi tu da'a. Gon ni ɓe'i ankayama den gǝskǝm gi kǝ shimliwo, bali ti nǝmi pa'e. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Gon ni ri'i cina dǝ mǝn bǝn kǝ dǝ tǝ nǝmi'i lulur gi kawo, za'i tǝ bar kǝ ghuntǝn gi esi. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Gon ni kem ki kǝ ɓomi asǝm kǝ mil nemo, ri nan ti kǝ mil rop. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Murgon ni lirki bargono, bi ti. Muntu ngen cigǝri karkiwo, ba kǝ nge ti bika da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndu mǝn nge gi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27">Luk 6.27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ kum yari'e kǝ ndu ya'i, kǝ nge mǝn nge gi. <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ama a yari ine, ndu ni mǝn nge gini. Shirǝm ni na Yam den mǝn kumi in dli. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Kǝn ni kǝ pi untuwo arni ki dǝm mimir kǝ ba gin kǝ to yamka. Tǝ kem dǝ pǝt gǝs ɗǝl den ho mbarǝm na wani mbarǝme. Tǝ kem dǝ ghon nde mǝn pitǝn dlat na munju ba pi dlat dagwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Kǝn ni kǝ ndu mǝn ju ba ndu kǝn katlo, unun ki zam we? Mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom ma untuni wu pi diya? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ya'i ni katl kǝ shirmi tiwo, unun kǝ pi kan man jen gwawe? Munju kan mom Yam dama untun wu pi. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ra'untuwo, dǝm ni na laai kandatu Ba gin kǝ to yamka ra na laa'i gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kulci den bi bari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />&lt;&lt;Ngup kǝnni, ba dǝ pitǝn dlat gin kǝ ɗǝɗa Yam dǝm kǝ shini kǝ ger da'a. Kǝn ni kǝ pi untuwo, ki zam ɓatltǝn kar Ba gin kǝ to yamka da'a.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Kǝn ni kii bi bar munju am ri wur kar dawo, ba kǝ pini ta shirǝm dene kandatu mǝn se mbarǝm ba pi kǝba domtǝn gǝzǝn na den guntǝp kǝ dǝ mbarǝm ɗǝɗa wur ra. Na ho bi, a yari ine, wu zam ɓatltǝn gǝzǝn ituwi <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ama kǝn ni ki bi bar muntu am ri ti kaar dawo, ba kǝ za ni da murgon mom argon tu kan kǝ pi gwa da'a. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Na untuni argon tu kǝ biwo ar ba dǝm na ghuuni. Ba gin kan ba shin argon tu ra na ghuuni gwani baa ɓatl kǝne.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den shirǝm na Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Kǝn ni ki shirǝm na Yamo, ba kǝ pi ni kandatu mǝn pi kǝ shini kǝ ger ba pi gwa da'a. Wu paye ndu'i wu shirǝm na Yam dlor kǝ ba domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda na den tǝpe, kǝ dǝ mbarǝm shin wur ra. Na ho bi, wu tare wu nǝm ɓatltǝn gǝzǝn ituwi. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ama kǝn ni ki shirǝm na Ba gin Yamo, te ni gin gip kushi, kǝ le ni bǝdlabǝnka, kǝ shirǝm ni na Ba gin kan ra ghuuni gwa. Ba gin kan ba shin argon tu kan ra na ghuuni gwa ba ɓatl kǝne.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Kǝn ni den shirǝm na Yamo, ba kǝ pi ni ta tlyari shirǝm da'a, kandatu munju kan mom Yam da'a ba pi gwa. Gip shini gǝzǝno, baa kum wur den womti shirǝm gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Ba kǝ dǝm ni wule wi da'a, domici Ba gin mom argon tu kǝ ndu gwa kapǝn kǝ lir ti.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Ra'untuwo, shirǝm ni na Yam nankǝni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">&lt;Ba gǝmi kǝ to yamka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">dǝ shin nartǝn kǝ sun gi.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Dǝ mulki gi suri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">Dǝ argon tu kǝ ndu gwa pi den kaar atl kandatu ar ra to yamka gwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Bi mi fingal gǝmi kǝ sekǝni.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ba kǝ nǝm mi den warwat pitǝn gǝmi da'a, kandatu mǝn ma mǝ pi munju pi mi wani pitǝn gwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ba kǝ za mi mǝ ndaka gip godetǝn da'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Ama ɗǝli mi am dǝ Mǝn ɗasi tu tu.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Kǝn ni kǝ nǝm mbarǝm den wani pitǝn gǝzǝn dawo, Ba gin kǝ to yamka ba nǝm kǝn den warwat pitǝn gin da'a pa'e. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ama kǝn ni kǝ nǝm mbarǝm den wani pitǝn tu wupi ino, Ba gin ma ti nǝm kǝn den warwat pitǝn gin pa'e.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den guzum male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Kǝn ni kǝ pi guzum malo, ba kǝ ɓalni ba gerka kandatu mǝn pi shini kǝ ger ba pi gwa da'a. Wu pi ni untu kǝ dǝ mbarǝm mom'e wu den guzum male. Na ho bi ni a yari ine, wu zam ɓatltǝn gǝzǝn ituwi. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ama ki ni den pi guzum malo, ho ba ger gika, kan kǝ bǝrke mir to gamka, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />zam ba dǝ mbarǝm mom'e ki den pi guzum mal da'a. Ama Ba gi kan mom argon tu ba pi mol gwa baa ɓatl ki.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den domi bar kǝ am to yamka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33">Luk 12.33</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Ba kǝ domini gam gin bar kǝ am den kaar atl da'a, las tu kan ghughur ba liika ko ar ruska gwa, las tu kan mur ba mani ɓuli wu pi murika gwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ama domi ni gam gin bar kǝ am gin to kar Yamka. To barta kawo arba ruska da'a, kan ga ghughur ba liika da'a. Mur ba mani ɓuli wu pi murika da'a. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Las tu kup bar kǝ am gi rawo, lasi ni mbatl gi ba nǝra.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cirtǝn kǝ dli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Ger ni'e cirtǝn kǝ dli. Ger gi nǝra lauwo, dli gi kup ba laa'i na cirtǝni. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ger gi nǝra waniwo, kup dli gi ba laa'i na dǝmǝni. Dǝ wule cirtǝn tu kan ra nan ki dǝmǝnno, dǝmǝni baa nge ger kǝ shini!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝmi zher kǝ Yami ko zher kǝ wurpi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16.13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Murgon ra kan baa mani bote babom rop gwa da'a. Ar ba dǝm'e ko tǝ nge nǝmi, tǝ ndu nǝmi, ko tǝ nǝra na nǝmi gip mbatl gǝsi, ko tǝ mbur nǝmi. Ki mani kǝ den bote Yam kan kǝ den bote wurpi es da'a.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dam kǝn ni da'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Ra'untuwo a yari ine, ba kǝ dam kǝn ni den dǝmi gin da'a? Argon tu ki ci ko ki tla, ko ki la den dli gin gwa. Dǝmi gin na ge mbatl man fingal da'aya, kan dliyi man tutul dli diya? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Shin ni yatl kǝ to yamka. Wu ngani ko wu rǝsh da'a. Wu pa dom gip ɓindi da'a. Kup na untu, Ba gin kǝ to yamka ni ba ci nan wuri. Ase, kǝ man wur nartǝn diya? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Woni gip kǝn den damtǝn gǝs baa mani mbǝli nye argon den muri gǝs rawu?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />To, unun kem kǝ dam kǝn den tutul kǝ dli we? Shin ni buzǝn kin kǝ gip lǝpe, den kandatu wu nar gwa. Wu pi mbap ko wu dlǝm tutul dli gǝzǝn dak. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Kup na untu a yari ine, ko Solomon na nartǝn gǝs taɓe la'i mbuni tutul dli man kǝ ko nǝm gǝzǝn da'a. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Dǝ wule untu ni Yam ba pi buzǝn kin kǝ gip lǝp na mbuntǝni, muntu kan ra sekǝni, kan gǝniwo, dǝ la ti gip utuka, kǝn ma tǝ mom nan kǝn diya? Kǝn mǝn heli ngǝshtǝn den Yami! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Ba kǝ dam kǝn ni kǝ wule, &lt;Unun mi ci wu?&gt; Ko &lt;Unun mi tla wu?&gt; Ko &lt;Unun mi la den dli gǝmi we?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Ba gin kǝ to yamka mom'e kǝ ndu bar ju kup. Munju kan mom Yam da'a ni ba dam wur den bar ju. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ama kǝno pare ni ngeni mulki kǝ Yam na pitǝn dlat gǝsi, nami bar ju kupo baa bi in esi. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Ra'untuwo, ba kǝ dam kǝn ni den gǝni da'a, domici gǝni baa ɗir na damtǝn gǝsi. Ko gonge pǝt ra na damtǝn gǝsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Ba kǝ shin ni bes kǝ murgon da'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk 6.37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />&lt;&lt;Ba kǝ shin ni bes kǝ murgon da'a, kǝn ma mbarǝm ba shin bes gin da'a. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Kandatu kǝ hukunte mbarǝmo, untu ni kǝn ma ba hukunte in pa'e. Na shandǝr nǝm tu kǝ cingǝriwo, na ri ni ba cingǝri in pa'e.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Unun kem ki den shini nye jir kǝ te ger dǝ ya'ika, o fawo basi nyash tu te ger da'i kawu? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Imnu ki mani wuli ya'i'e, &lt;Naa ɗǝli'i nye jir kǝ te ger da'ika,&gt; o fawo basi nyash ra te ger da'ikawe? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Ki mǝn pi shini kǝ gere, ɗǝli basi nyash kǝ te ger gika kakani, arni ki mani shini hoyi kan kǝ'i mani ɗǝli nye jir ya'i ter gerka.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Ba kǝ bini yer argon tu kan dlǝran ni anra gwa da'a. Ba kǝ la'i ni alade zo bar gin da'a. Kǝn ni kǝ pi untuwo, aladeyi baa desika, kan dǝ yeri pal wu tlyat kǝne.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liri ni, ngen ni, kǝ ɓo ni bǝdlabǝni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Pini ta liri ba bi ine, ngen ni ki zami, pini ta ɓe bǝdlabǝni, baa ɓuli ine. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Muntu kup liriwo ba bi ti. Muntu ngen ngapo ti zami. Muntu ɓo bǝdlabǝno, ba ɓuli ti.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Woni gip kǝn nya gǝs ni lir ti bǝrediwo, ti bi ti tatwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ko tin tǝ lir ti koso, tǝ bi ti iciwu? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Kǝn mǝn ɗasi tu ma, kǝ mani bi mimir gin ho bari, bare dǝ wule Ba gin kǝ to yamka baa bi munju ba lir ti gwa ho bari. <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Argon tu kup kǝ ndu dǝ mbarǝm pi ino, pi wur ni untu pa'e. Muntu ni'e Kulci kǝ Musa na kulci kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nye met bǝdlabǝni na ngǝlan bǝdlabǝni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Te ni gipi tǝp kǝba bǝdlabǝn kan ra met gwa. Rawo bǝdlabǝn tu kan ba ri mbarǝm ewo na ngǝlanyi ni ar ra. Kopi guntǝpi ban da'a, kan mǝn kopi tǝpi ra na womti. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ama tǝp tu kan mbarǝm ba kop dǝ zam ge mbatlo met ni ar ra. Kopi tǝpi ban naari, kan mǝn kopi tǝpi womti da'a.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba mani momi kin den gǝritǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Neni ger ndin, domici mir mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ lar kan ba ɗir kar kǝn gip tutul dli ka kur tǝm gwa, ama wi yer lǝp ni mǝn kumi guzum naari. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Ki mom wur ni tǝp kǝ ba mbap gǝzǝni. Ba mani kotli mimir inabi den kǝn ire, ko gǝri turum den kin goluma? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Untuni es ko gonge mbuni kin ba gǝri ni mbuni mimiri, ama wani kin ba gǝri ni wani mimiri. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Mbuni kin ba taɓe gǝri wani mimir da'a, untu es ar ba pi da'a dǝ wani kin gǝri ho mimiri. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Ko gonge kin kan gǝri ho mimir dawo, ba wotlka dǝ kerika. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Ra'untuwo, ki mani ni momi mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ lar ju den mbap gǝzǝni.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">A taɓe momi gin da'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:26">Luk 13.26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Ba'e kup mǝn wuli gǝn'e, &lt;Babomi, Babomi&gt; ni baa zam dǝ Yam dǝm gun gǝs da'a. Ama muntu ba pi argon tu Ban kǝ to yamka ndu dǝ pi gwa ni baa zami. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Na womti gin ba wulǝm'e den pǝta, &lt;Babomi, Babomi, na sun gini mǝ pi wazu diya, kano na sun gini mǝ ɗǝli dun itǝr na pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn na womti diya?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Kan a wul wur'e, &lt;A taɓe momi gin da'a. Tlin ni kǝba gerka kǝn munju nge kopi shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn tu'i bin mbarǝm rop</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Ra'untuwo, kup muntu kum shirǝm gǝn tu, kan tǝ pi mbap nariwo, ti ni ra wule mbarǝm mǝn bopya tu kan tu bom gǝs den tat gwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Kan bar ghon ni nda, bula ni la'i, kan itǝr ni hor ghon ni ɓe tor den biniwo, ar ba nda da'a, domici ɓa ni gǝs bini den tate. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ama kup muntu kum shirǝm gǝni, kan tǝ la gip mbatl gǝs tǝ pi mbap na ri dawo, ti ni wule kǝdlǝm tu kano tu bom gǝs den singes gwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ghon ni nda, kan ɓulani suri, itǝr hor be tor ar ɓo biniwo, kan dǝ bini ndaka, ndetǝni ba nge ger kǝ shini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Nan Yesu pa'i yari kup shirǝm juwo, ar ni domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi nǝm bi na am den kulci gǝsi, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />domici tǝ kulci wur wule muntu ra na iko gwa, ba'e wule kǝ mǝn kulci gǝzǝn den kulci kǝ Musa ni da'a.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu warke mbarǝm mǝn ndǝcci</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Nan Yesu ɗǝl sur den tlǝndǝro, ar ni mbarǝm na womti kop ti kaari. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ar ni mbarǝm gon mǝn ndǝcci ɗir ngus cina da ti, kan tǝ wule ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi kini kǝ ndu'o, ki palim dlǝran lasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu ta am gǝs ti taɓe mbarǝmi, kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A ndu kǝ dǝm dlǝran.&gt;&gt; Ar ri kǝtigon da'a, arni ndǝcci gǝs pa'i. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ɓashini, ba kǝ yari murgon argon tu kan pi gwa da'a, ama mbǝri, ri kar liɓa kǝ Yam ju wu shin ki, kan kǝ bi wur ɓatltǝn tu kulci kǝ Musa yari dǝ kǝ bi gwa, ar ni mbarǝm kup ba mom'e kǝ warke wi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:10">Lib 14.10</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngǝshtǝn den Yam kǝ bar mǝn bi'utu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Yoh 4.43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Nan Yesu te gip bǝn kǝ Kaparnahumo, arni bar mǝn bi'utu kǝ Roma gon ɗir kar ti, tǝ lir ti kǝ dǝ tǝ ne ti am ra. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, nye mǝn pim mbap gǝn ra rin bomka ɓom, itǝr tle ti dlika, tǝ den kumi dli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu wul ti'e &lt;&lt;Aa ri warke ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Ama bar mǝn bi'utuyi bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, a kǝm'e kǝ ri bom da'ǝm da'a. Ama pi shirǝm katl, nye mǝn mbap gǝn ba pal lau. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Domici ami ma gǝsi dǝ gon ni ami ra, na mǝn bi'utu jen gǝsi da'ǝmi. A wul gon'e, &lt;Rǝka,&gt; kan tǝ ri, gon eso a wul ti'e, &lt;Ɗiri&gt; kan tǝ ɗiri. A wul zher gǝn'e, &lt;Pi nankǝni,&gt; kano, tǝ pi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Nan Yesu kum untuwo, arni tǝ nǝm bi na ame. Kan tǝ wul mǝn kopi kar gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, a taɓe zami murgon gip Isra'ila na ngǝshtǝn den Yam na ndǝrtǝn wule kǝ mbarǝm kǝn da'a. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />A yari ine, jen na womti mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yam wule muntu baa ɗǝl ɗǝr tor gabǝs na sur yemma wu dǝm kǝ ci nyel na ga kori gǝmi Ibǝrahim, Ishaku, na Yakubu gip dǝmi kǝ Yam gun gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ama mǝn Israila kan ndari wu zam dǝ Yam dǝm gun gǝzǝn kan nge gǝzǝno, baa la wur gip bar dǝmǝni, las tu kan wi kul na ngǝngash shine.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Ar ni Yesu wul bar mǝn bi'utu kǝ Romayi'e, &lt;&lt;Ndara, ba pi'i den kandatu kǝ ngǝsh ki den Yam gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni mǝn pi mbap gǝsi warke gip wokoci tu wu shirǝm gwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pǝni kumi dli nya kon kǝ Bitǝrus ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Nan Yesu te gip bom kǝ Bitǝruso, ar ni tǝ shin nakon kǝ Bitǝrus ɓom, dli gǝs wi utuka. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Ar ni Yesu taɓe am kǝ nagǝr mǝri, kan wi utu kǝ dliyi ba za ti. Kano nagǝr mǝri ba tlyam tǝ pi ti mbapi.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pǝni kumi dli mbarǝm na womtika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nan sit piwo, ar ni ɗiri munju dun itǝr ba ghunwur gwa na womti kar Yesu. Na yari shirǝm ni katl tǝ ɗǝli wur dun itǝr gǝzǝnka. Kan tǝ warke munju den kumi dli gwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Tǝ pini muntu kǝ dǝ laa'i shirǝm kǝ Ishaya mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">&lt;&lt;Na gam gǝs ni tǝ pǝni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">mi kumi dli gǝmika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">kan tǝ ɗǝli bar ju</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">ba ɗiri holi kumi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">tǝmi kǝ dlika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn wultǝn'e wi kop Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Gasi gon nan Yesu shin mbarǝm na womti gandǝl tiwo, arni tǝ wule dǝ pal te den kǝti bishidi kǝ bar ɓula'i ka. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Kapǝn wu ndarawo, arni nǝm gip mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa ɗir kar ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, aa kop ki las tu ki ri kup gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Ama Yesu bali ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yer lǝp ra na shu gǝzǝni, kan ga yatl ra na bin gǝzǝni, ama ami Nya Mbarǝm ra na las tu tǝ mur gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Ar ni gon gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, za'ǝm kakani, kǝ dǝ a ri bom a kap ban.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ama Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝni, za mǝshi mbarǝm gip ruhu wu kap ezǝn mǝshi mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu matl itǝr mǝn ndǝrtǝni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Nan tǝ te gip kungulǝn jikat malo, arni mir mǝn kulci kar ti kop ti. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Wule gip jipkǝr gere, nan wu ra den gam malo, arni bar dun yam tli gip bar ɓula'i, kan ba tatl tor gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali. Ama Yesu den nde umuri. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti ri putu tika, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ɗǝlimi! Mǝ ri kǝ mǝshtǝn wi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Tǝ nǝmi wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem bǝrti nǝm kǝnka naar untuwu, kǝn mǝn heli ngǝshtǝn den Yami?&gt;&gt; Arni tǝ tlyam kan tǝ matl itǝr na zap mali kan lasi kup ba sa shot.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti nǝm bi na ame, kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unu badǝr mbarǝm ni'e muntuwe? Ga itǝr na zap mal kup ba kop shirǝm gǝsi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke mǝn zhe'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Nan tǝ cwat gip kǝti bar ɓula'i gip atl kǝ mǝn Garasinawo, ar ni mǝn zhe'e jen rop ɗǝl ter gip gambici'e wu zam ti. Wu dǝmka bar kǝ bǝrtiwi har murgon ba'i mani kopi tǝp lasi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ar ni wu la yar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu nan miwu, Nya Yami? Kǝ ɗir ni kǝ dǝ kǝ kumi mi dli kapǝn dǝ wokoci piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Te cinaka njem nan wuro, alade jen ra na womti kan den le gǝzǝn gwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Arni dun itǝri lir Yesu, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kini kǝ ɗǝli mikawo, za mi mǝ te gip alade mǝn womtitǝn ja.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Bǝrni!&gt;&gt; Kan wu ɗǝl gip mbarǝm mi wu te gip aladeyi, arni aladeyi yem sur bi tlǝndǝr na kǝtǝr wu su ro gip bar ɓula'i, wu mǝsh su gip malika. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Mǝn le aladeyi kǝtǝr te gip bǝnika, wu yari bar ju kup kan pi na mbarǝm mǝn dun itǝri gwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Mbarǝm kǝ bǝni kup ɗǝl ɗir kǝ dǝ wu mo na Yesu. Nan wu shin tiwo, arni wu lir ti dǝ tǝ za'i wur kǝti atl gǝzǝni.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu warke muntu itǝr tle ti dli kagwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Ar ni Yesu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat male, tǝ jikat bar ɓula'i tǝ te gip bǝn gǝs Kaparnahum. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Mbarǝm jen ɗiri ti mbarǝm gon kan itǝr tle ti dli kagwa, ɓom den ba muri. Nan Yesu shin ngǝshtǝn den Yam gǝzǝno, arni tǝ wul muntu itǝr tle tikayi'e, &lt;&lt;Ba ar ghunki da'a, nya gǝni, pǝni'i warwat pitǝn gi kawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Na kumi untuwo, ar ni jen gip mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa dami gip mbatl gǝzǝn wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu ba cingǝr gam gǝs na Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ama Yesu mom damtǝn gǝzǝni, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝn kǝ wani damtǝn gip mbatl ginwe? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ar mani na dǝ wule, &lt;Pǝni'i warwat pitǝn gi kawi,&gt; ko dǝ wule, &lt;Tlyam kǝ desi?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ama nan a ndu kǝ mom'e Nya mbarǝm ra na iko kǝ pǝni warwat pitǝnka den kaar atlo&gt;&gt; ar ni tǝ wul muntu itǝr tle ti amika'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyami, pǝn bamuri gi, kǝ ndara bomi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Kan mbarǝmi ba tlyam tǝ ndara bomi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Nan domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi shin argon tu piwo, arni bǝrti nǝm wur naari, kan wu ɗǝɗa Yam muntu bi mbarǝm mani pi untuyi gwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la bi Matta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Nan Yesu ri cinawo, ar ni tǝ shin mbarǝm gon mǝn sun Matta, njon kǝba nǝmi wurpi bomi. Yesu wulti'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝni.&gt;&gt; Kan Matta ba tlyam tǝ kop Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, Yesu den ci fingal rǝn bom da Matta kawo, ar ni mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na mǝn warwat pitǝn na womti ɗir dǝm wu den ci fingal nan ti na mir mǝn kulci kar ti. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Nan mǝn me gam kǝ mǝn Parise shin untuwo, ar ni wu gen momi kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem mǝn kulci gin ba ci na mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na mǝn warwat pitǝn we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Nan Yesu kum untuwo, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba'e munju kan ra lau ni ba ndu mǝn bi un da'a, ama mǝn kumi dli ni. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ama ri kulci ni kǝ mom ni argon tu shirǝm kǝ Yam yari gwa, &lt;Amo dǝmi na guna ger ni a ndu kar kǝne, ba'e mboshim dabba gip bota ni da'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6.6</ref>.</char></note>&gt; A sur ni kǝ dǝ a la bi mǝn pitǝn dlat da'a, ama mǝn warwat pitǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngeni momi den pi guzum male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Gasi gono mir mǝn kulci kar Yohana mǝn pi Batisma ri kar Yesu kǝ dǝ wu ngen momi kar ti, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem min na mǝn me gam kǝ mǝn Parise ba pi guzum male, ama mir mǝn kulci kar ki ba pi da'a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Berǝm kǝ mǝn pel gǝr baa pi ni dun mbatl wokoci tu wura kǝ ba gudlumiyi na mǝn pel gǝri ya? Wokoci den ɗirtǝne nan ba pǝni wur mǝn pel gǝri kagwa. Wokoci ta ni wi pi guzum male. <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Untu ni esi, woni ba jep pel tutul den gus tutul dliwe? Domici gus tutul dliyi ba tlyatka ar man kǝ far tlyattǝni. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Untuni esi, murgon ba shoti pel mal kin inabi su gip kor zurum ka kuur da'a. Tini tǝ pi untuwo, pel mal kin inabi tu ba tatl kuur tuka kan ar shotka, kuuri eso ar lika ituwi. Untuni da'a, pel mal kin inabiwo, dǝ shot ti gip pel zurum ka kuri, na untu ni pel mal gǝri kin inabiyi kup na zurumi baa sa ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tli nye gǝr kan mǝshka gwa kan tǝ warke gǝr mǝtli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Nan tǝ gip shirǝm nan wuro, ar ni bari kǝ bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda gon ngus cina dati, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝn tuni nya gǝn nye mǝtli mǝshka. Ama ɗir kǝ ne am den ti, tǝ pal ra na ge mbatli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Ar ni Yesu tlyam na mir mǝn kulci kar ti, kan wu ri na mbarǝmi.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Gip untuwo arni nagǝr gon muntu kan bǝran ba shot gip ti kǝ sheti ghon kutl cet rop ɗir tǝp kaar dati, tǝ ne am den bi lulur gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Tǝ wul tor mbatl'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ni a ne am den tutul dli gǝs katlo, a warke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Nan Yesu bali ger tǝ shin tiwo, arni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba ar ghun ki da'a, nya gǝni, ngǝshtǝn den Yam gi warke iwi.&gt;&gt; Ar ri kǝtǝ gon da'a, ar ni nagǝri warke.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Nan Yesu mbubar bom dǝ bari kǝ mǝn kopi na mbarǝmiwo, se tǝ shin mǝn hori mǝzhele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dǝ mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ilawo ba ngen mǝn hori mǝzhele wu hor kǝ kulu mǝshtǝn mbarǝm ni mǝshka gwa</char></note> na mbarǝm na womti den ta kulu. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Ama Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Tli ni bar tu. Nye gǝri mǝsh nika da'a, umur ni ti dene.&gt;&gt; Arni wu gyatli ti gip mburtǝne. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Nan kar mbarǝmi te kari kawo, ti te gipi tǝ nǝm am kǝ nye gǝri, kan nye gǝri ba tlyami. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Shirǝm bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn tu ri gip kǝti atli kup.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke tabi na bebe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Nan Yesu ci cina na ritǝno, ar ni tabi moni jen rop kop ti, wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Gǝsgal kǝ Dauda! Kum guna gǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Nan tǝ te gip bom gono, ar ni tabiyi kop ti teka, kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ nǝm gip mbatl gǝn'e aa mani warke gina?&gt;&gt; Arni wu nǝmi ti'e, &lt;&lt;Aan, Babomi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Kan tǝ ne am den ger gǝzǝn tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Den bi ngǝshtǝn gin demǝn ni, ar ba dǝmi in untu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Ar ni ger gǝzǝn ɓul kan wu mani shini bari. Kan Yesu ba dǝli wur kǝm hoyi, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ yari ni murgon argon tu kan pi gwa da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ama wu ndarawo arni wu pi ta yari argon tu tǝ pi wur gwa gip atli kup.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Wu den bi za'i lasi ituwi, kan ba ɗǝri ti mbarǝm gon mǝn dun itǝr kan ba mani shirǝm dagwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Nan Yesu ɗǝli ti dun itǝrikawo, ar ni mbarǝmi nǝm shirǝmi. Domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi nǝm bi na am wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ taɓe shini argon pi wule muntu gip Isra'ila da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ama mǝn me gam kǝ mǝn Parise wule, &lt;&lt;Na ndǝrtǝn kǝ gun dun itǝr ni tǝ ɗǝli dun itǝri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guna ci Yesu den mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu kop gip ga bǝni kup na gip mir bǝn kǝ bi lǝpi, tǝ den pi wazu na kulci wur zo shirǝm kǝ mulki kǝ Yam gip ba domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. Tǝ den warke gǝzǝn den ko gonge kumi dli na ciwo kan ba ghun wur gwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Nan tǝ shin nartǝn kǝ domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmo, guna ci ti den wuri, domici wura den ta ndotǝne. Mǝn ne wur am ra da'a, wule tǝm ju kan ra na mǝn tle gǝzǝn dagwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ar ni tǝ wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝni naari, ama mǝn rǝshi kǝni ngapo njem ni wura. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ra'untuwo, lir ni Babom mǝn rǝshi kǝni, tǝ kari in bar ra na mǝn mbap wu rǝshi ti kǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kar kutl-cet ropi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu la bi mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet rop (12), tǝ bi wur iko wu ɗǝli dun itǝr na warke mǝn kumi dli, na ko gonge ciwo. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Sun kǝ mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl-cet ropi ni'e, kǝ nǝm Simon (muntu ba la ti bi'e, Bitǝrus gwa) na esi Andǝrawus. Yakubu nya Zabadi na esi Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filibus, Bartolomi, Toma, na Matiyu mǝn nǝmi wurpi bomi. Yakubu nya Alpayus, na Tadawus. <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simon mǝn ghuve kǝ bǝn gǝsi, Yahuda Iskariyoti, muntu kan bi Yesu kagwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kar kutl-cet ropi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Wi kutl cet ropi ni Yesu kar wur na la'i wur tat cina'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ rǝni cina dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa, ko kǝ teni gip bǝn kǝ mǝn Samariya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ama rǝni kar tǝm kǝ Isra'ila kan jilka gwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Kǝn ni kǝ ri gwa lani icin kǝ wul ni'e, &lt;Mulki kǝ Yam mbira wi kosak.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Warke ni kumi dli kǝ mbarǝm ka, tli ni munju kan mǝsh kǝ pali ni munju kan ra na ndǝcci gwa dlǝran, kǝ ɗǝli ni dun itǝrka. Bi in ni, kǝn ma bi ni pa'e. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ba kǝ pǝn ni wurpi kǝ zǝnariya, ko azurpa, ko mundu gip posh gin da'a. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Ba kǝ pǝn ni posh gip ɓomi asǝm gin da'a, ko tutul dli goni, ko kaptǝlanye, ko dlo, domici muntu kan pi mbapo tǝ ndari dǝ bi ti argon tu tǝ ndu gwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Bǝn tu kǝ te gipi kup, ko mir bǝn kǝ markǝmiwo, ngen ni ho mbarǝm kan gip bǝni gwa, kǝ dǝm ni gip bom gǝzǝn ar ri gas tu ki za lasi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Kǝn ni kǝ te gip bomiwo, kǝ shirmi ni mǝn bomi. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />In ho mbarǝm ni gip bomiwo, lir ni Yam kǝ dǝ tǝ bi wur dǝmi zhǝlili, ama in ho mbarǝm ni dawo, ba dǝ Yam bi wur dǝmi zhǝlili da'a. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Gon gǝzǝn ni nge nǝmi gini, ko nge kumi shirǝm gin kawo, na kǝ za bomi ko bǝniwo bat ni kushka kǝ asǝm ginka lasi. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari in'e, ba kum guna den bǝn kǝ Sodom na Gomora gas tloyi shirǝm ar man kǝ bǝn tu.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumi dli mǝn ɗirtǝne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mar 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Aan, a kar kǝn ni wule tǝm gip dlom kǝ yer lǝpe. Se kǝ dǝm ni na wayo wule ici'e, na dǝmi bat na ɓarna wule kuburi. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Ama ngup kǝn ni na mbarǝm ju, domici wi ta kǝn am dǝ mǝn bǝni, kan dǝ ɓo in na rǝɓa gip bom domtǝn gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Baa ɗir kǝn cina dǝ kiri kǝ bǝni, na ga gunye, domici gǝni, kǝ dǝ kǝ la ni icin kǝ zo shirǝm demǝni cina da wuri, na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ama wini wu nǝm kǝno, ba ar ghun kǝn ni den argon tu ki yari gwa da'a. Baa bi in argon tu ki yari gwa gip wokociyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kǝn ni ki dǝm mǝn shirǝmi da'a. Ruhu kǝ Yam ni ba shirǝm tǝp kar kǝne.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Erǝm ba bi erǝm gǝska kǝ dǝ ri ti eka, bǝba ba bi nya gǝska, untuni es mimir ba tli gam mǝn gǝri gǝzǝn wu kem dǝ ri wur eka. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Mbarǝm kup ba nge ine domici gǝni. Ama muntu kup ɓa mbatl dlom gam bari patǝn kǝ baro, ti zam ɗǝltǝne. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />In kumi in dli gip bǝn kǝno, ri ni gin gip bǝni kǝ cina. Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, kapǝn kǝ pa'i kopi mir bǝn kǝ Isra'ilawo Nya Mbarǝm baa pal sur wi.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Nye mǝn kulci baa man muntu ba kulci ti gwa da'a, ko dǝ wule dǝ zher man babom gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ar ndari dǝ nye mǝn kulci dǝm wule muntu ba kulci ti gwa, zhero tǝ dǝm wule babom gǝsi. Tun nan ami babomi la'ǝm bi Ba'alzabu gun dun itǝro, imnu ba la bi mir mǝn bomiwe?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu ndari dǝ kum bǝrti gǝs gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Ama ba kǝ kum ni bǝrti gǝzǝn da'a. Argon ra kan ra na ghupi kan baa ɓulka den kari dagwa, argon ra na ghuuni kan ba hol momi da gwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Argon tu a yari in gip dǝmǝno, yari ni kǝ ba cirtǝni. Argon tu a yari in su kǝm kawo, la ni icin deni dǝ ko gonge mbarǝm kumi. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Ba kǝ kum ni bǝrti kǝ mǝn ri mbarǝm eka da'a, domici wi mani ri ruhu kǝ mbarǝm eka da'a. Ama kum ni bǝrti kǝ Yami, muntu kan ba mani li dlika, na la'i mbatli gip utu gwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ba wur ni mir yatl ropka den kabarshu nǝm diya? Yatl gon ra kan ba nda atl bat na momi kǝ Ba gin gwa da'a. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ta gam gin ma na dlǝmi ni ar ra. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ra'untuwo, ba dǝ bǝrti ci in ni da'a, nartǝn gin man kǝ yatl hoyi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sede Yesu cina dǝ mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luk 12.8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Muntu kup sede ti gwan ni cina dǝ mbarǝmo, ami ma aa sede'e ti gwan ni cina dǝ Ban kǝ to yamka. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Muntu kup nge sede ti gwan ni cina dǝ mbarǝmo, ami ma aa nge sede'e ti gwan ni cina dǝ Ban kǝ to yamka.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm baa nge in den kǝn mǝn kopi Yesu ni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14.26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Ba kǝ pǝn ni'e, a siri in ni dǝmi zhǝlili den kaar atl da'a! A siri in ni dǝmi zhǝlili da'a, se dlanye.<verse eid="MAT 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />&lt;A sur ni kǝ dǝ a haɗe nya na base, nye mǝtli na nase, gǝr kushi na nakon gǝsi.<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Mbarǝm kǝ bom nǝm baa dǝm mǝn nge babomi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Muntu ba ndu bas ko nas manǝmo, tǝ kǝm tǝ dǝm gwan da'a. Muntu kan es ba ndu nya gǝs moni ko nye mǝtli nar manǝmo, tǝ kǝm tǝ dǝm gwan da'a. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Muntu kup pǝn kin kǝ ɓa'i gam gǝs dene tǝ kopǝn dawo, tǝ kǝm dǝmi gwan da'a. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Muntu kup ndu ge mbatl gǝso, ti hol zami gǝsi. Ama muntu kup kan hol ge mbatl gǝs den bi gǝno, ti zam ge mbatli.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbap zami ɓatltǝne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mar 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Muntu kup nǝm kǝno, amin tǝ nǝmǝni. Muntu nǝmǝn ngapo, tǝ nǝm ni muntu karǝm sur gwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Muntu kup nǝm mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam den ti mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yamno, ti zam albarka kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami. Muntu es nǝm mǝn pitǝn dlat, den ti mǝn pitǝn dlatno, ti zam albarka kǝ mǝn pitǝn dlat. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Muntu kup bi wuro mal mǝn iɗatǝn nǝm gip mir heli mimir ju den ti mǝn kopi gǝnno, a yari ine, ti hol zami albarka gǝs da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yohana mǝn batisma kar mir mǝn kulci gǝsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Nan Yesu pa'i pi shirǝm ju mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl cet ropiwo, ar ni tǝ za lasi tǝ ndara gip kǝti atl kǝ mǝn Galili tǝ ci cina na kulci na la'i icin kǝ shirǝm kǝ Yam gip mir bǝn gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Wokoci tawo le Yohana ka gip bom kǝ moni, kan tǝ kum bar ju Almasihu den pi, arni tǝ kar mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs wu ri tambe Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e mbarǝm tu kan mǝn den ɓuti gwaya, ko mǝ ɓut gon esi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Pal ni rǝn kar Yohanaka, kǝ yari tǝ ni argon tu kǝ shin kan kǝ kum gwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Tabi den zami shini, kurki den desi, mǝn ndǝcci den zami dǝmi dlǝran, munju ba kum dama wu den kumi, den tli munju kan mǝsh kagwa, ba pi wazu munju kan am ri wur kar dagwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Mǝn albarka ni'e, munju nge kopi gǝn den kandatu ami ra gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Nan mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yohanayi ndarawo, ar ni Yesu pi mbarǝm ju ra lasi gwa shirǝm den Yohana tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ shin rǝn bi lǝpka ya? Wosh kan itǝr ba kaɗe gwana? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ko kǝ ɗǝl ni kǝ shini mbarǝm tu kan la mbuni tutul dli gwa? O'o, untu ni dawo, unun kǝ ri kǝ shini we? Gip shini gino, kii shin ni mbarǝm mǝn ho tutul dliya? Ai mǝn kemi ho tutul dliwo bom dǝ gun ni wu nǝra. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />To, unun kǝ ɗǝl kǝ shiniwe? Mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yama? Aan, a yari ine, tǝ man mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam nartǝni. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ti ni'e mbarǝm tu rǝsh den ti gip shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa'e, &lt;Aa kar nye mǝn kartǝn bar gǝn cina da'i, muntu kan baa kǝrkǝmi'i guntǝp gi gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />A yari in ge shirǝmi, gip munju mǝtli ni gǝr wuro, gon ra kan nar man Yohana mǝn pi batisma gwa da'a. Ama muntu kan'e heli gip mulki kǝ Yamo, tǝ man ti.<verse eid="MAT 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Tun wokoci kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma har kǝkǝni, den ta la'i icin kǝ shirǝm kǝ dǝmi kǝ Yam gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝme, ama kǝkǝno ko gonge mbarǝm den ta totǝn kǝ tetǝne. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Domici kulci kǝ Musa na tǝlankur kǝ ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kup pini kǝ mulkiyi kapǝn cwattǝn kǝ Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Kǝn ni kǝ nǝm argon tu wu yariwo, ti ni'e Iliya tu kan yari'e ti sur gwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Muntu kup ra na kǝm kǝ kumiwo, naa tǝ kumi.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />To, na unun aa ngash mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝnwe? Wini wule mimir kan den cet gip deɓǝr gwa, wu den la'i bi berǝm cet gǝzǝn wu den wultǝn'e,<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />&lt;Mǝ hori in mǝzhele</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">ama kǝ dlar da'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">mǝ wuli in kon kulu keti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">ama kǝ kul da'a.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Artu Yohana mǝn pi batisma ɗir tǝ pi ta ci na tle dawo, kǝ wule, &lt;Ti mǝn itǝr ni.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Ar tu Nya Mbarǝm ɗir ti den ci na tlewo, ar ni kǝ wule, &lt;Mǝn totǝn den ci na tle ni, berǝm kǝ mǝn nǝmi wurpi bomi, na mǝn warwat pitǝne.&gt; Kup na untu, mǝ mani ni shini bopya kǝ Yam tǝp kǝ ba argon tu tǝ pi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bǝn ju nge ci atl gam gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ar ni Yesu matl mir bǝn ju kan tǝ pi mbap kǝ nǝmi bi na am gip wur gwa, ama wu ci atl gam da'a. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Bar kǝ guna ni'e kǝn mbarǝm kǝ bǝn kǝ Korazina! Bar kǝ guna ni'e kǝn mbarǝm kǝ bǝn kǝ Betsaida! Na dǝ wule bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju kan pi gip kǝn gwa ni pi gip Taya na Sidono, na wu ci atl gam na la'i lusguru, wu den hurwa na wi mudlǝr sur gam wi. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ama a yari in'e gas tloyi shirǝmo, baa kum guna kǝ mbarǝm kǝ Korazina na Betsaida man kǝ Taya na Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Kǝn mbarǝm kǝ Kaparnahum ngapo, kǝ shin wule, baa ɗǝɗa kǝn ni ar to yama? O' o baa pali in ni atli, kǝ ba dǝmi kǝ mǝshtǝni. Dǝ wule bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju pi gip kǝn ni pi gip Sodomo, na tii nǝra har sekǝni. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ama a yari inka, gas pǝt tloyi shirǝmo, ba kum guna kǝ mbarǝm kǝ Sodom ar man kəne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗir ni karǝm kǝ zam ni shukutǝni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21">Luk 10.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Gip wokoci tawo, arni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;A goode'i, Bǝba na Babom kǝ yam na atli, domici kǝ ghundǝri bar jen mǝn bopya na mǝn momi bar kǝ atl kǝnka, kan kǝ ɓuli heli mimiri. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Aan, untu ni Bǝba, domici untu ni ar mbuni'i.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Ko gonge baro Bǝba bim kawi. Murgon ra kan mom Nyayi gwa da'a, se Bǝbayi, eso murgon ra kan mon Bǝbayi gwa da'a, se Nyayi, na muntu kan Nyayi ndu kǝ tǝ ɓuli ti momi gwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Ar ni Yesu wule, ɗir ni karǝmi kup gin kan ar banyi in wi, kan es den patǝn na giɓǝr gosgam gwa, aa bi in shukutǝni. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Pǝn ni shirǝm gǝn wule kandatu tla gi kǝn ba pǝn dlo ɓali witta gi kǝn den yar gwa, kan kǝ kulci ni karǝmi, domici ami mǝn ghalǝm mbatl ni, mǝn pali gamka atli, ki zami gam gin shukutǝni. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Domici kulci gǝn ban da'a, kan gosgam gǝn ngapo hoptan ni ar ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ngeni momi den pǝt shukutǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Den pǝt shukutǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda gono, Yesu den kopi gip kǝn alkama. Mir mǝn kulci kar ti ngapo wu den kumi guzumi ar ni wu nǝm marti gam alkamayi wu den ci. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ama nan jen gip mǝn Parise shin untuwo, ar ni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Shinca, mir mǝn kulci kar ki den pi argon tu kulci kǝ Musa wule ba dǝ pi da'a gas shukutǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ taɓe ni zhiti argon tu Dauda pi wokoci tu tǝ kum guzum, nan ti na mbarǝm gǝs gwa da'a ya? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Kandatu tǝ te gip bom kǝ Yami, kan wu ci bǝredi tu kan neka markǝme, kup na ar ndari'e wu ci da'a se mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa ni katl ba ci. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Eso kǝ taɓe ni zhiti gip tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa diya? Kandatu liɓa kǝ Yam ba cen doka kǝ pǝt shukutǝnka den ko gonge pǝt shukutǝni gip bom kǝ Yam, ama ar dǝm'e warwat pitǝn ni wu pi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />A yari ine, muntu kan man bom kǝ Yam gwan kǝni. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />O na kǝ mom ni argon tu rǝsh gwa'e, &lt;Amiwo guna ger ni a ndu'e kǝ nǝra nari, ba'e mboshi bar dǝ ta'i Yam ni katl ghunǝm da'a.&gt; Na kii shin wani pitǝn kǝ munju hol wani pitǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Domici Nya mbarǝm ni'e Babom kǝ pǝt shukutǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke muntu itǝr tle ti am kagwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Nan Yesu za lasiwo, ar ni tǝ te kǝ ba domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mbarǝm gon ra lasi muntu kan itǝr tle ti am ka gwa. Ar ni wu gen momi kar Yesu wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa yari den'e dǝ pǝni mǝn kumi dli kumi dli gǝska den pǝt shukutǝna?&gt;&gt; Wu yari ni untu kǝ dǝ wu ri ti cina ni.<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Woni gip kǝn kan tǝm gǝs nǝm ni nda shuka den pǝt shukutǝno, tii ɗǝli ti tor ka dawu? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Mbarǝm man tǝm naari! Ra'untuwo, tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa nge'e dǝ pi ho bar den pǝt shukutǝn da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ar ni Yesu wul mbarǝmi'e, &lt;&lt;Ta am gi.&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ ta ami, kan ba pal lau wule ami mǝn nǝm. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ama mǝn Pariseyi ɗǝl gǝzǝn kan wu bali kandatu wii pi wu ri Yesu eka gwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zǝzar zher kǝ Yam ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Nan tǝ mon argon tu wu den ndu'i pi kawo, ar ni tǝ za lasi. Mbarǝm na womti kop ti, kan tǝ pǝni mǝn kumi dli kup kumi dli gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Ama tǝ dǝli wur kǝm den'e ba wu yari murgon ko ti woni da'a. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Untu pini kanda tu Yam yari bi dǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya gwa'e,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Zher gǝn kǝni muntu kan a zǝzari, muntu a ndu gwa, nan ti ni a pi ghol mbatl hoyi. Aa laa'i ti na Ruhu gǝni, Tii pi la'i icin kǝ tloyi shirǝm kan ra dlat gwa den atl na womti.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Tii tli yar yam ko tǝ shirǝm na mati yar ko dǝ kum yar gǝs den ko gonge tǝp da'a.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Wosh tu kan tatl kawo, tii cenka da'a, utu pǝtǝla tu kan bari kǝ mǝshtǝnkawo, tii mǝshka da'a, se ti ni tǝ kem dǝ pitǝn dlat ci cina.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Gip sun gǝs ni munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kup baa la mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ba'alzabu Gun dun itǝri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ar ni wu ɗiri ti mbarǝm gon kan ngubbi ni, tabi ni, kan ra es na dun itǝr gwa. Yesu warke ti, kan tǝ mani shirǝmi, na shini bari. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Ar ni mbarǝm kup nǝm bi na ame, kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu ni'e Nya Dauda tu diya?&gt;&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yam pi gudlum shirǝm nan wur ter ka'e gǝs gal kǝ Dauda gon ra kan baa dǝm ti ni'e mǝn ɗǝli mbarǝm gwa</char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ama nan mǝn Parise kum untuwo, ar ni wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Na iko kǝ Ba'alzabu gun kǝ dun itǝr ni mbarǝmtu ba ɗǝli dun itǝr ju.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Nan Yesu mon damtǝn gǝzǝnkawo, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mulki tu kup kan tatlka bomi rop kan den shini bes kǝ esiwo, mulkiyi ba dlǝr da'a. Kup bǝn ko bom na mbarǝm ju kan tatlka bomi ropo, bǝni ko bomi ba dlǝr da'a. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Shetan ni ba ɗǝli shetano, tǝ den dlan na gam gǝs ituwi. To imnu mulki gǝs ba dlǝr rawu? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />O na iko kǝ Ba'alzabu ni a ɗǝli dun itǝro, to mbarǝm gin fa? Na iko kǝ woni wu ɗǝli dun itǝr we? Mbarǝm gin ni baa tloyi in shirǝm den muntu. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ama na Ruhu kǝ Yamni a ɗǝli dun itǝro, dǝmi kǝ Yam gun gip mbatl kǝ mbarǝm ɗir kar kǝn ituwi.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Kii mani tetǝn gip bom kǝ ndǝri mbarǝm kǝ yemi ti barka da'a, se ki ni kǝ ɓal ti kakani, kan kǝ'i mbu tetǝn gip bom gǝs kǝ yemi ti barka. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Muntu kan ra namǝn dawo, mǝn gapa na mǝn ni, kan muntu kup nem amra gip domi dawo, mǝn gǝzanyika ni. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ra'untuwo a yari ine, baa gaparte mbarǝm ko gonge warwat pitǝn gǝs na shirǝm mburtǝn gǝsi. Ama muntu yari mǝgǝn shirǝm den Ruhu kǝ Yamo, baa gaparte ti da'a. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Muntu kup pi mǝgǝn shirǝm den Nya mbarǝmo, ba gaparte ti, ama muntu kan pi mǝgǝn shirǝm den Ruhu kǝ Yamo, ba gaparte ti da'a, ko kǝkǝni ko gas patǝn kǝ bar kup.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kin na gǝrintǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Ho kin ni ba gǝri ho mimiri, wani kin ni ba gǝri wani mimiri. Ba mani ni momi kin den mimir ju tǝ gǝri gwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Kǝn badǝr kǝ wonzi! Imnu kii mani yari ho bari, nan kǝn mǝn ɗasi tu ni gwawu? Domici argon tu kan ra su gip mbatlka gwani bi ba yari. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mbarǝm mǝn zo mbatlo, tor gip zo mbatl gǝs ni tǝ pi ho shirǝmi, mǝn ɗasi tu ngapo gip ɗastǝn kǝ tu gǝs ni tǝ ɗǝli wani bari. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />A yari ine, kup mǝgǝn shirǝm tu kan mbarǝm yariwo, tii dlǝm na nǝm nǝm gas tloyi shirǝmi. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Den shirǝm gi ni ba tloyi'i shirǝmi, ko ar kem kǝ dǝm mǝn ho pitǝne ko mǝn wani pitǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise den ngeni shini bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar 8.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 8:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ar ni jen gip mǝn Parise na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur Kulci kǝ Musa wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mǝ ndu'e kǝ pi mi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn kan ba gode'e sur kar Yamni kǝ ɗǝl gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn mǝn ɗasi tu'e, mǝn nge pitǝn dlat den ngeni dǝ pi wur argon tu kan ba gode'e sur kar Yam ni a ɗǝl gwa. Ama baa pi wur bar kə dləkəntən gon da'a, se bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn wule muntu kan zam mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Yunana gwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Wule kandatu Yunana pi muri myakan pǝt na gas gip tu dǝ bar koso, untu ni es Nya Mbarǝm ba pi muri myakan pǝt na gas gip gam bici'e. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Gas tloyi shirǝmo, mbarǝm kǝ Nineba ba tlyam na mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni, mǝn Nineba ba gode mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn den wu pi dlat da'a. Domici mǝn Ninebawo, wu ci atl gam den wazu kǝ Yunana, ar tu muntu kan man Yunana gwan kǝni ama wu ci atl gam da'a.<verse eid="MAT 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Gas tloyi shirǝmo, Gun kǝ Sheba gǝr mutli baa tlyam na mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni, tǝ gode wur'e wu pi dlat da'a. Domici tǝwo, ɗir kǝ ba dlyami las ni tǝ ɗǝli, kǝ dǝ tǝ kum shirǝm bopya kǝ gun Solomon, ar tu muntu kan man Solomon gwan kǝni ama kǝ kum ti da'a.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paltǝn kǝ dun itǝri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />Dun itǝr ni ɗǝl ka gip mbarǝmo, tǝ ɗǝl ni tǝ nǝm nǝtltǝn las tu kan mal ra da gwa den ngeni ba shukutǝni, ama ti ni tǝ zam ba shukutǝni dawo, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />se tǝ wule, &lt;Aa pal rǝn bom gǝnka las tu a ɗǝl gwa.&gt; Ti ni tǝ pal lasi, tǝ zam bomi koni, kan tǝ shin sar bomika, kǝrkǝmi kawo, <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />se dǝ dun itǝri pal rǝnka tǝ ngen jen gudǝli nyingi munju kan man ti ɗasi tu gwa, wu ɗir dǝm gip bomi. Dǝmi kǝ mbarǝmi baa man kǝ far wantǝni. Untu ni ar baa dǝmi mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mir mǝn gǝpi kǝ Yesu na nazini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Nan Yesu den shirǝm na womti mbarǝmiwo, se nas na mir mǝn gǝpi gǝs ni jǝn dlor kaari den ɓuti kǝ dǝ wu shirǝm nan ti. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ar ni gon wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Nǝna gi na ga mir mǝn gǝpi gi ra te kaari ka, wu den ndu'i shirǝm nan ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Woni'e nǝna gǝni? Eso ga woni'e mir mǝn gǝpi gǝnwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ar ni tǝ ta am den mir mǝn kulci karti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nǝna na mir mǝn gǝpi gǝn ju!<verse eid="MAT 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kup murgon tu ba pi argon tu Ban kǝ to yamka ba ndu dǝ piwo, ti ni'e mǝn gǝpi gǝn mǝtli na moni na nǝna gǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mǝn ngani badǝre</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Gasi ni Yesu ɗǝl gip bomi, kan tǝ ri dǝm bi bar ɓula'i. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Ar ni mbarǝm na womti gandǝl tika, kan tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jǝkat mal tǝ dǝm gipi, ar ni mbarǝm kup dlǝr bi ɓula'i. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Yesu yari wur bar na womti, na misali tǝ wule. &lt;&lt;Mǝn kǝn gon ra ri gip kǝn gǝs kǝ ngani badǝre. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Tǝ gip ngani badǝri ituwi, ar ni badǝri jen ro den tǝpe kan yatl ba ɗir ɗamika. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Badǝri jen ba ro den atl kan ra den sǝla, kan ba yatl bǝle-bǝle domici atl ra lasi hoyi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Ama nan pǝt mato, ar ni badǝri kerka kan ba konka, domici wi ra na tlǝrti hoyi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Kan badǝri jen ba ro gip lundume, nan wu naro kan lundumi ba tla wurka. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Eso, ar ni badǝri jen ro den ho bar atli, kan ba yetli ar ba bi ge, geyi jeno hauya nantam, jeno hauya myakan jen eso hauya nǝm na kutl. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Muntu kan na kǝm kumiwo, naa tǝ kumi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Argontu kem a shirǝm na misali gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luk 8.9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti wul ti'e &lt;&lt;imnu kǝ shirǝm na mbarǝm na ngashi den bar jen we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝno bi in momi sǝrri kǝ mulki kǝ to yamka, ama wiwo bi wur da'a. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Muntu kan ra na baro baa mbǝli ti ra, ti zam ra naari. Muntu kan ra na bar da ngapo, ba nǝm nye jem tu kan tǝra narika gwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Argon tu kem A shirǝm nan wur na ngashi den bar jen gwa ni'e, &lt;Ko wu zhit ma, wii shin da'a, ko wu kar na kǝmma, wii kum ko wu mom argon tu ba yari gwa da'a.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Den wur ni shirǝm kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya laa'i e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">&lt;Wii pi ta kumi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">ama wii mom da'a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">eso wii pi ta zhiti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">ama wii shin da'a ko njem.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Domici mbatl kǝ mbarǝm ju raka na lati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">wu kesh kǝm gǝzǝn kawi bǝse wu kumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">wu le ger gǝzǝn kawi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">bǝse wu shin na ger gǝzǝni wu pa kum na kǝm gǝzǝni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">Ra'untuwo, ger gǝzǝn ba shin da'a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ko wu kum na kǝm gǝzǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kǝ dǝ mbatl gǝzǝn pǝn wu pal karǝm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">a warke wur ra.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Ama kǝn mǝn albarka ni domici ger gin ba shini, eso kǝm gin ba kumi. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine, mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam na mǝn pitǝn dlat na womti ndu shini argon tu kǝn den shini gwa, ama wu shin da'a, wu pa ndu kumi argon tu kǝn den kumi gwa, ama wu kum da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Argon tu shirǝm kǝ ngani bari ba pi nufi gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />&lt;&lt;Kum ni argon tu misali kǝ mǝn ngani kǝn tu ba shirǝm deni gwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Muntu kum shirǝm kǝ Yam kan tǝ mom kandayi dawo, Shetan mǝn ɗasi tu'i baa ɗir tǝ tus argon tu kan ngani gip mbatl gǝska gwa. Muntu ni'e badǝr tu kan nda den tǝp gwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Badǝr tu kan nda den alt kan ra den sǝla wo, ti ni'e, muntu kan na kumi shirǝm kǝ Yamo, se tǝ nǝm na ghol mbatli. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ama nan tǝ ra na tlǝrti dawo, tǝ daɗe da'a. Wokoci tu ghuntǝn ko kumi dli zam ti den shirǝm kǝ Yamo, se tǝ za tǝpka. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Badǝr tu kan nda gip lundumo, ti ni'e mbarǝm tu kan kum shirǝm kǝ Yami, ama damtǝn kǝ atl na ndu'i bar kǝ am tlaa shirǝmika, kan shirǝmi i mani pi ti ho bar da'a. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Baɗǝr tu kan nda den ho atl ngapo, ti ni'e mbarǝm tu kan kum shirǝm kǝ Yam na momi argon tu shirǝmi yari gwa. Tǝ pi mbap nari tǝ gǝr mimir gucipi hauya nantam (100), gono hauya myakan, (60) gon ngapo hauya nǝm na kutl (30).&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jir gip alkama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Ar ni Yesu pa yari wur shirǝm es'e, &lt;&lt;Mulki kǝ Yam nǝra wule mbarǝm tu kan ngani ho badǝr gip kǝn gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Nan mbarǝm kup den umuro, ar ni mǝn nge gǝs ri ngani badǝr jir gip kǝn alkamayi, kan tǝ ndara won gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Nan alkamayi nar den ɗǝli gamo, ar ni jiri ma tli tori. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Ar ni ga zher kǝ Babomi ri wul ti'e &lt;Babomi, ho badǝr ni mǝ ngani gip kǝn gi da'aya? Im ni jir pa yetl gipi we?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Ar ni Babomi bali wur'e &lt;Mǝn nge gǝn ni pi untu.&gt; Ar ni ga zher gǝsi wul ti'e, &lt;Kǝ ndu mǝ ri tus jiri kaya?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Ama Babomi wul wur'e, &lt;O'o,&gt; den tusi jiri kawo, ki tuska na alkamayi. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Za ni wu nar tare ar ri gas rǝshi. Wokoci tani a yari mǝn rǝshi kǝni'e wu pare tloyi jiri wu ɓalka ɗap-ɗap kǝ dǝ keri ka, kan alkamayi ngapo dǝ ri ɓindika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den ge mastad</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-21">Luk 13.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu pa shirǝm nan wur na misali tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mulki kǝ Yamo ar nǝra wule ge mastad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mastad wo mir yaya badǝr ni muntu ra wule ge dǝnti gwa.</char></note>, kan mbarǝm gon pǝn kan tǝ ngani gip kǝn gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Kup na ar ni'e heli gip badǝr kup, ama ti ni tǝ naro, ar ba man nami mir kini, ar ba ɓo am har dǝ yatl zam ba tu'i bin gǝzǝn den ami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali kǝ Yisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu pa yari wur shirǝm gon es tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mulki kǝ Yamo ar ni wule yisti, muntu kan nagǝr gon kushkǝli gip ɗapti shandǝr myakan kan ba nga ɗaptiyi kup gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm na misali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33">Mar 4.33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 4:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Shirǝm ju kup Yesu yari domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi wo, tǝ yari wur na misali den bar jeni. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Bar ju pi ni kup kandatu mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya yari gwa'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">&lt;&lt;Aa shirǝm nan wur na misali den bar jeni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">aa yari wur argon tu kan ra na ghuuni terka na ne gǝs kǝ pi atl kundǝrǝndlip gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Argon tu shirǝm den jir gip alkama ba pi nufi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Ar ni Yesu za domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi tǝ te gip bomi. Kan mir mǝn kulci karti ba ɗir kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yari mi kanda kǝ jir kǝ gip kǝn tu ngapi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan ngani ho badǝriwo, ti ni'e Nya Mbarǝme. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Kǝni ngapo arni'e atl kundǝrǝndlip, ho badǝriwo wi ni'e mimir kǝ mulki kǝ yami. Jiri ngapo wi ni'e mimir kǝ mǝn ɗasi tu tu. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Kano mǝn nge gǝn kan ngani jiri ni'e shetan. Wokoci rǝshi ni'e patǝn kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip. Mǝn rǝshi kǝni ni'e mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Wule kandatu ba dom jir dǝ keri kawo, untu patǝn kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip baa nǝra. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Nya Mbarǝm baa kar mir mǝn kartǝn gǝsi wu dom bar ju kup ba kem mbarǝm kǝ pi warwat pitǝn gwa, na mǝn pi wani bari, dǝ ɗǝli wurka gip mulki kǝ yami. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Dǝ la wur te gip bom kǝ utuka. Barta ni wi kul na ngasi kur bi. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Mǝn pitǝn dlat ngapo wi cir wule pǝt gip mulki kǝ Bazini. Muntu kup na kǝm kumiwo, naa tǝ kumi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den bar kǝ am kan ra na ghuuni gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />&lt;&lt;Mulki kǝ Yamo wule bar kǝ am ni kan ghundǝrika gip kǝn gwa. Mbarǝm ni zamo, se tǝ ri ghundǝrika gip kǝni esi, na ghol mbatl gǝsi kan tǝ wur argon tu tǝra narika kup, kan tǝ wur kǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den tat mǝn wurpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />&lt;&lt;Eso, mulki kǝ Yamo wule ba mǝn bar pǝtni ar ra, mǝn ngeni zo tat ju ba wurka gwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Nan tǝ zam zo tat mǝn wurpi hoyiwo, se tǝ ri wur argon tu kup tǝra nari ka gwa kan tǝ wur tati.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den shar nǝmi kose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />&lt;&lt;Eso, mulki kǝ Yamo wule, zan shar nǝmi kos ni ar ra, kan la gip mal dǝ nǝm ko gonge badǝr kos gwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Nan wu dǝl shari tor bishidi la'i na koso, ar ni mǝn nǝmi kosi dǝm kan wu zǝzar ho kos wu wi gip shari, kan munju kos ni dawo wu wika. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Untuni ar baa dǝm gas patǝn kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip. Mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam baa ɗǝli mǝn ɗasi tuka gip mǝn pitǝn dlat, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />wu la mǝn ɗasi tu'i te gip bom utuka, lasi ni wi kul na ngasi kur bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gus bar na pel bari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule,&lt;&lt;Kǝ mani momi bar ju kup a kulci in gwa wa?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Aan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ra untuwo, kup mǝn kulci mbarǝm den kulci kǝ Musa nan zam kulci den mulki kǝ yamo, ti ni wule babom tu kan ɗǝli bar kǝ am gǝs peli na gusi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba shin nartǝn kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gip bǝn gǝs da'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Nan Yesu pa'i yari shirǝm den bar juwo, ar ni tǝ za lasi. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Tǝ pal su Nazarat ka, bǝn gǝsi. Ar ni tǝ nǝmi kulci mbarǝm gip bom domtǝn gǝzǝni, kano ko gonge gǝzǝn ba nǝm bi na am wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni tǝ zam bopya na bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn juwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ti nya kapinta tu ni diya? Eso nas ni'e, Maryamu da'aya? Kan mir ezǝn ni'e ga Yakubu na Isubu na Saminu na Yahuda diya? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Mir ezǝn mǝtli eso, mǝn ra nan wur diya? Akoni mbarǝn kǝn zam bopya na bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ju kam? <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ar ni lo ci wur den ti. Ama Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba ɗǝɗa mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ko ako ama bat na bǝn gǝs na gip bom gǝsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Lasiwo, Yesu pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn womti da'a domici kǝ holi ngǝshtǝn gǝzǝn den Yami.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Gip wokoci ta ni gun Hirudus kum kiri bar ju Yesu den pi gwa, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />ar ni tǝ wul mǝn pi ti mbap'e, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo, Yohana mǝn pi batisma ni tli gip mǝshi mbarǝme, ar ni kem tǝ pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ju ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Domici gip muri jawo, Hirudus kem nǝm Yohana, ba ɓal ti, kan ba la ti gip bom moni domici kǝ Hirudiya nagǝr kǝ esi Filibus. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Den'e Yohana yari ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ndari kǝ gudlumi na Hirudiya da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Hirudus ndu'e, tǝ ri Yohana eka, ama bǝrti ci ti den mbarǝme, domici wu pǝn'e Yohanawo mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ama nan gas nyel kǝ dami pǝt gǝri kǝ Hirudus ɗiro, ar ni nya Hirudiya nye mǝtli dlar cina dǝ mbarǝme, ar kon Hirudus naari. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Ar ni Hirudus ɓe nyayi am atl tǝ wul ti'e, tii bi ti kup argon tu tǝ liri gwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Kan nasi nyayi ba yari ti argon tu tii liri gwa, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ bim gam kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma gip gal kin kǝkǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ar ni dun mbatl nǝm gun Hirudus hoyi. Ama tǝ tare tǝ ɓo am atl kawi, na wotli bi gǝs cina dǝ kiri kǝ ba ci, tǝ bi bi dǝ bi ti. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Tǝ kem ba kotǝl gam kǝ Yohana kan ra gip bom moni gwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ba ɗǝri gam kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batismayi gip gal kini, ba bi nye gǝri kan tǝ bi nase. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yohanayi ɗir pǝn dli gǝs kan wu kapka. Kan wu ri yari Yesu argon tu pigwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bi fingal mbarǝm zangu nantam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Nan Yesu kum untuwo, ar ni tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal kan tǝ ndara las tu mbarǝm ra dagwa. Ama nan mbarǝm kum untuwo, ar ni wu ɗǝl ɗir gip mir bǝn gǝzǝni wu kop ti den asǝm rǝn las tu tǝ ra kagwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Nan Yesu ɗǝl sur gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali kan tǝ shin domtǝn kǝ mbarǝm na womtiwo, ar ni guna ci ti den wuri, kan tǝ pǝni jen kumi dli gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nan sit piwo, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti ɗir kar ti, wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗewo gip lǝp ni, mbarǝm ra da'a, artu gas den ndetǝn wi. Ar baa mani kǝ za mbarǝm ju wu ndara wu ri gip mir bǝn jen wu wur fingal wu ci diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Ama Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba'e ar nǝm ni dǝ mbarǝmi ndara da'a. Bi wur ni fingal wu ci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Miwo, bǝredi nantam na kos rop ni katl mǝn ra nari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Tǝ wul wur'e &lt;&lt;Ɗirim ni ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Kan Yesu ba wul mbarǝmi'e, wu dǝm atl den jiri. Tǝ pǝn bǝredi nantam na kos ropi, tǝ tli gam tǝ goode Yam kan tǝ cecceni tǝ bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti wu bi domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Kup gǝzǝn ba ci wu laa'i tu gǝzǝni, kan wu dom mir roɓǝs burodiyi nan sagwa, ba laa'i shar kutl-cet rop. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Womtitǝn kǝ mbarǝm ju kan ci fingali pi wule moni bar kǝ zangu nantam (5,000) bat na mǝtli na mimiri.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu desi den gam male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ar ni Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi'e, wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat male wu kur jikati te bi shidiyi bartaka. Kan tǝ za mbarǝmi wu ndara. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Nan tǝ za mbarǝmi wu ndarawo, ar ni tǝ to den tlǝndǝr kǝ dǝ tǝ shirǝm na Yami. Tǝra to den tlǝndǝrika nangǝsi ba ri bi siti. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Ama wokociyiwo kungǝlǝn jikat mali ra te dlom bar ɓula'ika zab mal den dǝli gǝs ɗe na barta, domici itǝr mǝn nartǝn den gapa na kungǝlǝn jikat mali.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kǝ bǝtloni, bar kǝ gǝlla am myakano, ar ni Yesu bǝtl gam te kar kungǝlǝn jikat malika, tǝ den desi den gam mali. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ama nan mir mǝn kulci kar ti shin ti den desi den gam malo, ar ni bǝrti ci wuri, wu la yar gip bǝrti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tlon ni!.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Na zhotǝne ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba ar ghun kǝn ni da'a, mi ni. Ba dǝ bǝrti ci in ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Ar ni Bitǝrus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ki ni fawo, bim bi a desi te den gam malka, a te kar ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;teri.&gt;&gt; Ar ni Bitǝrus ɗǝl sur gip kungǝlǝn jǝkat mali tǝ nǝm desi tǝ den tetǝn kar Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ama nan Bitǝrus shin ndǝrtǝn kǝ itǝriwo, ar ni bǝrti ci ti, tǝ nǝm sitǝnka gǝs male. Kan tǝ la yar tǝ wule,&lt;&lt;Babomi ɗǝli mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Ar ni Yesu nǝm am kǝ Bitǝrus na zhotǝne tǝ dǝl ti tor tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki mǝn kali ngǝshtǝn den Yami, unun zote'i la'i mbatl gi demǝn kawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Nan wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat maliwo, ar ni itǝri za wultǝne. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ar ni munju kan ra gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali ba bote ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi, ki Nya Yam ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pǝni kumi dli mbarǝm ka gip Janisarata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Nan wu jikat bar ɓula'iwo, ar ni wu dlǝr gip bǝn Janisarata. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Nan mbarǝm kǝ bǝni mom'e Yesuno, ar ni wu kar bar dǝ yari ko gonge mbarǝm kan ra gip mir bǝn kǝ lasi, kan wu ɗiri munju kup den kumi dli gwa kar ti. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Ar ni wu liri Yesu den dǝ mǝn kumi dliyi ne am den bi tutul dli gǝs katl. Kup mǝn kumi dliyi kan ne am den tutul dliyiwo, ar ni wu warke.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Al'ada kǝ mǝn cina gǝmi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Gip untuwo ar ni mǝn Parise na mǝn kulci doka kǝ Musa jen ɗǝl tor Urshalima wu ri kar Yesu wu ngen momi kar-ti, wu wule, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />&lt;&lt;Unun kem mir mǝn kulci kar ki ba nge pi al'ada tu kiri gǝmi wule dǝ pi gwa wu? Wu ho am gǝzǝn, kan wu'i ci fingal da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝno, unun kem kǝ cen doka kǝ Yamka den bi al'ada ginu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Domici Yam wule, &lt;Kǝ bi nartǝn bǝba, na nǝna gi&gt; kano, &lt;Kup muntu zage bas ko naso, ar nǝm dǝ ri ti eka.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ama kǝ kulci mbarǝm'e, gon ni wul bas ko nas'e, &lt;Argon tu ndari a bi ino, a tare a bi Yam kawi,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />ar nǝm tǝ bi nartǝn mǝn gǝri gǝs da'a ituwi. Den bi kǝ al'ada gino, kǝ pali shirǝm kǝ Yamka wop ituwi. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Kǝn mǝn setǝne! Kor ni ar ra nan mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya yari den kǝn gwa'e. <verse eid="MAT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />&lt;Mbarǝm juwo na bi ni katl wu ɗǝɗa'ǝmi, ama mbatl gǝnzǝno ar dlyam ka na mǝni. <verse eid="MAT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Katl ni wu bote mi. Doka kǝ mbarǝm ni wu kulci jen den bi shirǝm kǝ Yami.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Argon tu ba li mbarǝm ka cina dǝ Yam gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu la bi domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi ɗir kar ti, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kum ni kǝ mom ni argon tu ar kǝ yari in gwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ba'e argon tu mbarǝm ba ci gwa ni ba li ti da'a, ama argon tu ba ɗǝl ter bi da ti gwa ni ba li ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti ɗir wu tambe ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;O kǝ mom'e lo ci jen gip mǝn Parise ju den argon tu kǝ yari gwaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Badǝr tu kup kan yetl muntu kan Ban kǝ to yamka ni ngani dawo, baa tuska na gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Za wur ni, ga tabi ni'e mǝn nǝmi dlo ezǝn tabi. Ngapo tabi ni ba nǝmi esi tabi dlowo, kup gǝzǝn wi nda shuka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Ar ni Bitǝrus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yari mi kanda kǝ shirǝm tu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu wule wur'e &lt;&lt;Har kǝkǝn gam gin i'ni su tat kaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ mom ni den'e, argon tu kǝ ci te bikawo, tu ni ba su kan ar'i ɗǝl kaari da'aya? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ama argon tu ba ɗǝl ter biwo, tor mbatl ni ba ɗǝli, eso ar ni ba li mbarǝm cina dǝ Yami. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Domici tor gip mbatl ni damtǝn kǝ wani pitǝn ba ɗǝli, wule ga ri mbarǝm eka, muri na gǝr ko kos kǝ goni, muri na jen kan ndari da gwa, pi mure, seda kǝ lare na lii mbarǝm gami. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Munju ni ba li mbarǝme, ba'e ho'i am kan dǝ'i nde ci fingal ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngǝshtǝn den yam kǝ na gǝr goni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Kan Yesu ba za lasi, tǝ ndara kǝti atl kǝ Taya na Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Lasi ni nagǝr gon mǝn Kan'ana tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, Nya Dauda, shin guna gǝni! Dun itǝr ne den kumi nya gǝn nye mǝtli dli hoyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ama Yesu wul ti'e argon da'a. Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti ɗir kar ti wu lir ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kar nagǝr tu tǝ ndara ngapi, domici tǝ ghun mi na kulu wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu nǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Amo kar tǝm kǝ Isra'ila kan jilka gwa ni katl karǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Ama nagǝri ngus cina dǝ Yesu tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, nem am ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ndari dǝ pǝn fingal kǝ mimir dǝ bi yer da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Nagǝri wule, &lt;&lt;Untu ni ar ra Babomi, ama yer ma wu ci roɓǝs fingal ju kan ba ro sur den tebǝl kǝ Babom gǝzǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Kan Yesu ba wul nagǝri'e, &lt;&lt;Ngǝshtǝn gi den Yamo ar naari! Nǝmi'i lirtǝn gi wi.&gt;&gt; Ar ni nya gǝs warke gip wokociyi.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke mbarǝm na womti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Ar ni Yesu za lasi, tǝ su kop bi bar ɓula kǝ Galili. Kan tǝ to den tlǝndǝr tǝ dǝm toka. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Kan mbarǝm na womti ba ɗir kar ti, wu ɗiri ti munju itǝr tle wur kagwa, na ga tabi, ga kurki, na ga ghup bi, na nami mǝn kumi dli na womti, wu ne wur cina da ti kan tǝ pǝni wur kumi dli gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ar ni mbarǝm kan ra lasi gwa nǝm bi na ame nan wu shin munju kan ghup bi ni den shirǝmi, munju itǝr tle wurka pal lauwi, kurki den desi, na munju kan tabi ni den shiniwi. Ar ni wu ɗǝɗa Yam kǝ Isra'ila.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bi fingal mbarǝm zangu wupse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Ar ni Yesu la bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Guna ba cim den mbarǝm ju, domici muri myakan ikǝnwi wu ra namǝni, wura na fingal da'a. A ndu'e wu ndara na guzum da'a, bǝse wu ɗatka den tǝpe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ako ni mii zam fingal tu kan baa kǝm mbarǝm na womti ju gip lǝp kǝnu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu ngen momi kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bǝredi mǝne ni kǝn ra nari?&gt;&gt; Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nyingi, na mir kos jeni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yesu wul domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi'e, wu dǝm atli. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Kan tǝ pǝn bǝredi nyingi ju na kosi, nan tǝ goode Yamo, kan tǝ cecceni tǝ bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti, wu bi mbarǝmi. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi kup ci wu la'i tu gǝzǝni. Den kariwo, mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba dom roɓǝs bǝredi na kosi nan sagwa ba laa'i shar nyingi. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Womtitǝn kǝ mbarǝm ju ciwo ar pi moni zangu wupse (4,000), bat na mǝtli na mimiri. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Nan Yesu wul mbarǝmi wu ndara bomo, ar ni tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat male, kan tǝ ndara kǝti atl kǝ Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Ngeni alama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Mǝn Parise na mǝn Sadukiya jen ɗir kar Yesu kǝ dǝ wu gode ti, ar ni wu lir ti, den tǝ pi wur bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am kan ba gode'e sur yam ni tǝ ɗǝl gwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Sit ni pi kan Yam ba zil kawo, kǝ wule, &lt;bǝni baa mbuni.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Kǝ cigǝni kǝn ni, kǝ shin yam ni zilka, kan dun yam ni tli toro, kǝ wule, &lt;Sekǝno ghon baa nda.&gt; Kǝ mani momi kanda kǝ pitǝn kǝ to yamka, ama kǝ mani momi kanda kǝ pitǝn kǝ zhan kǝn da'a. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Kǝn zhan mǝn ɗasi tu'e na mǝn nge Yami, kǝn den ngeni dǝ pi in bar kǝ nǝmi bi na ame, ama ko nǝm baa pi in bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am da'a, se bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am kan zam Yunana gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu ndara.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisti kǝ mǝn Parise na mǝn Sadukiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Nan mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu jǝkati te bi shidi bar ta kawo, ar ni wu mom'e wu mǝsǝn pǝni bǝredi ka. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Ar ni Yesu wul mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Ngup kǝn ni, kǝtǝri ni yisti kǝ mǝn Parise, na kǝ mǝn Sadukiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Ar ni wu shirǝm na ezǝn wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ko nan mǝ ɗir na bǝredi da'i gwa ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Ama nan Yesu mom'e wu den bali gip dlom gǝzǝno, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn kali ngǝshtǝn den Yami! Unun kem kǝn den damtǝn den fingalu? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Kǝkǝn ma kǝ mom wi diya? Kǝ mǝsǝni ni ka na mbarǝm zangu nantam (5,000) ju kan a bi wur fingal kǝ bǝredi nantam gwaya? Roɓǝsi ju sawo, laa'i shar mǝnen kǝ dom we? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ko mbarǝm zangu wupse (4,000) ju kan a bi wur fingal kǝ bǝredi nyingiwo, shar mǝne ni kǝ dom kǝ roɓǝsi kan sa gwa wu? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Unu arin kem har kǝkǝn kǝ mom dawu? Kǝ shin wule den fǝngal ni a shirǝma?&gt;&gt; A yari in ra, &lt;&lt;Kǝtǝri ni yisti kǝ mǝn Parise na kǝ mǝn Sadukiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti mom'e, den yisti kǝ bǝredi ni tǝ den shirǝm da'a, ama den wu kǝtǝri kulcitǝn kǝ lar kǝ mǝn Parise na kǝ mǝn Sadukiya ni tǝ den shirǝmi.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus bi seda den'e Yesu ni'e Almasihu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Nan Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti mbu bar kǝti atl kǝ Kaisariya kǝ Filibiwo, ar ni tǝ tambe mir mǝn kulci kar ti tǝ wule &lt;&lt;Woni mbarǝm ba wul Nya mbarǝm we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Jen ba wule, ki Yohana mǝn pi batǝsma ni, jen eso wu wule, ki Iliya ni, jen ngapo wu wule ki Irimiya ni, ko gon gip mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ngapo, kǝ wul ni'e ami woni we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Ar ni Simon Bitǝrus nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e, Almasihu Nya Yam mǝn ge mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;ki mǝn albarka ni, Simon nya Yunana, mbarǝm ni gode'i momi bar tu da'a, ama Ban kǝ to yam ka ni ɓuli'i. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />A yari'i ka, ki ni'e Bitǝrus, ki ni'e tat tu kan aa tu domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi dene, muntu kan mǝshtǝn baa nǝ ra na iko dene dagwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Aa bi'i bar kǝ ɓuli mulki kǝ to yamka, argon tu kǝ dar bi dene sur atlo ar ba dǝm argon tu tare dar bi dene to yam kagwa, eso argon tu kǝ pǝtlka sur atlo, ar dǝm na pǝtli ni ar ra to yamka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ar ni Yesu dǝli mir mǝn kulci kar ti kǝm hoyi den ba wu yari murgon'e ti ni'e, Almasihuyi da'a.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yari kanda kǝ mǝshtǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mar 8.31—9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Gasi ni Yesu pare yari mir mǝn kulci kar ti den'e, ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ te Urshalima, tǝ kum dli na ko gonge kumi dli am dǝ kiri kǝ mǝn bǝn na kiri firist na mǝn kulci mbarǝm doka kǝ Musa kan dǝ ri ti eka, den pǝt kǝ myakano dǝ tli ti na ge mbatl esi. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Ar ni Bitǝrus la tǝ bi markǝme, tǝ matl ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ Yam saukake, babomi, untu ba pi nan ki da'a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ama Yesu bal ti den Bitǝrus tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tli karǝmka, Shetan! Ki tat pati asǝm ni karǝmi. Domici damtǝn kǝ bar kǝ Yam ra su mbatl da'i ka da'a se damtǝn kǝ bar kǝ mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Kan Yesu ba wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kup muntu ba ndu kopi gǝno, ar nǝm ti te yarka, tǝ nge gam gǝs tǝ pǝn kin ɓatǝn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kin ɓatǝn </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wokoci kǝ mǝn Romawo, muntu pi mur ko warwat pitǝn gon kan ndari dǝ ri ti ekawo, den kin ni ba ɓa ti. </char></note> gǝs kan tǝ kopǝni. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Domici muntu kup ba ndu ga'i mbatl gǝso, tii holka. Ama muntu ba bi ge mbatl gǝs domici gǝno, tii zam ge mbatli. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Unun baa ɓite'i kin kǝ zam atl kundǝrǝndlip kan kǝ hol ge mbatl giwu? Ko unun kii mani bi den bi ge mbatl giwe? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Domici, Nya Mbarǝm baa sur na mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gip ɗǝɗatǝn kǝ Base, kan tǝ ɓatl ko gonge mbarǝm den bi argon tu tǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, jen gip kin kan ra dlor ɗewo, wi mǝsh da'a, se wi ni wu shin surtǝn kǝ Nya Mbarǝm gip nartǝn gǝs kǝ gunye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Dli kǝ Yesu sanjeka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Den kaar kǝ muri mukkawo, ar ni Yesu pǝn Bitǝrus, Yakubu na Yohana erǝm kǝ Yakubu, tǝ te wur den tlǝndǝr mǝn tlyartǝn wu nan gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Ar ni dli kǝ Yesu palka gholi, kan ba ger gǝs ba cirka wule cirtǝn kǝ pǝte, den shini kǝ ger gǝzǝni, kan tutul dli gǝs ba gholka kulen wule cirtǝni. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Wule gip njǝpkǝr gere ar ni Musa na Iliya ɗǝl kar wur wu den shirǝm na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Ar ni Bitǝrus wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi ar mbun kan mǝn ra ɗe gwa. Ki ni kǝ ndu'o, aa pi mir kuptǝkup myakan, nǝm ge, nǝm kǝ Musa, nǝm eso kǝ Iliya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Tǝ gip shirǝmo, ar ni dun yam mǝn cirtǝn ghum wurka, kan wu kum yar gon gip dun yami ba wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu ni'e Nya gǝni a ndu ti hoyi, nan ti ni a pi ghol mbatl naari, kum tǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Nan mir mǝn kulci kar ti kum untuwo, ar ni bǝrti ci wuri, kan wu nda atl na gip tu'e. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Ama Yesu ɗir kan tǝ ne am den wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tli ni yami, ba dǝ bǝrti ci in ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Nan wu tli gero, wu'i shin murgon da'a, se Yesu nan gǝsi.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Nan wu den ɗǝltǝn sur den tlǝndǝriwo, ar ni Yesu dǝli wur kǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ yari ni murgon argon tu kǝ shin gwa da'a, se tli Nya mbarǝm gip mǝshi mbarǝm kakani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa ba kulci'e, Iliya ni baa cwat kakani?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Untu ni, Iliya baa suri, tii sur ni tǝ kǝrkǝm ko unu. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ama a yari inka, Iliya sur wi, ngapo wu mom'e ti ni da'a, ar ni wu pi ti argon tu wu ndu pi gwa. Untu ni es Nya mbarǝm baa kum dli am da wuri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti mom'e ti ni den pi wur shirǝm den Yohana mǝn pi batisma.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pǝni kumi dli nye mǝn kumi dli ndetǝn ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Nan wu mbu bar kar mbarǝm na womtiyiwo, ar ni mbarǝm gon ɗir kar Yesu tǝ ngus cina da ti, tǝ wul ti'e, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />&lt;&lt;Babomi, kum guna kǝ nya gǝni, domici tǝ den patǝn na kumi dli hoyi kǝ ndetǝne, ar ba kur byal ti gip utu, ko gip male. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />A ri ti kar mir mǝn kulci kar ki, ama wu mani pǝni ti kumi dliyika da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu nǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn zhan kan na ngǝshtǝn den Yam da'a mǝn jiltǝni! Har gigasi ni a nǝra nan kǝne, ar ri gigasin aa ci cina na te mbatl kaarka nan kǝnu? Ɗirim ni nyayi ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Ar ni Yesu matl dun itǝr kan ra gip nyayi gwa. Ar dlyam da'a, ar ni nyayi pal lau. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Kan mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba ri kar ti wokoci tu mbarǝm'i kar wur dagwa, wu ngen momi kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem mǝ mani ɗǝli dun itǝrika dawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu nǝmi wur, tǝ wule &lt;&lt;Kǝn ra na kali ngǝshtǝn den Yam ni kemi. Na ho bi ni a yari ine, dǝ wule kǝn nǝra na ngǝshtǝn den Yam wule ge dǝntǝwo, ki wul tlǝndǝr tu'e, &lt;Tli bartu kǝ ri barta,&gt; tii tli. Argon ra kan ki hol mani pi gwa da'a.<verse eid="MAT 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />[Ɗǝli dun itǝr wule munju ba pi da'a, se na shirǝm na Yami na guzum male<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor tǝlankuri jeno wu na ayayi muntu da'a.</char></note>.]&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm es den mǝshtǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Nan mir mǝn kulci kar ti dom wur su Galili kawo, ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Baa bi Nya mbarǝmka am dǝ mbarǝme. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Wii ri ti eka, ama den pǝt kǝ myakano, baa tli tika gip mǝshi mbarǝme.&gt;&gt; Ar ni shirǝmi ghun mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓatli wurpi bom kǝ bom kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Nan Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti yi mbubar Kaparnahumo, ar ni mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom kǝ bom kǝ Yam zam Bitǝrus wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝn kulci gin ba ɓatl wurpi bom kǝ Yama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Bitǝrus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Aan, tǝ ɓatli.&gt;&gt; Nan Bitǝrus te gip bomiwo, ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti pi shǝrǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Simon! Unun kǝ shin den momi tu tǝ ngen kar ki gwa we? Kar ga won ga gun kǝ atl ba nǝm wurpi bomi, kar mimir gǝzǝn na, ko kar jen ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Nan Bitǝrus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kar jen ni wu nǝmo&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;O, mimir gǝzǝno ar ra gam da wur da'a ituwi! <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Kup na untu, bǝse mǝ ci wur lo'o, su bar ɓula'i, kǝ la coli. Kos tu kǝ pare nǝmi gǝso, ɓul bi gǝsi, kii zam kabarshu nǝm. Pǝn kabarshuyi kǝ ɓatl wurpi bom kǝ bom kǝ Yami nari, gwan na ge ituwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Bari gip mulki kǝ to yam ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Gip wokoci tawo, mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu ɗir kǝ ngeni momi kar ti, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Woni baa ni'e bari gip mulki kǝ to yam kawe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Ar ni Yesu la bi nye heli nya goni, tǝ ne ti dlor gip dlom gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine, kǝn ni kǝ pali gam gin wule heli mimir dawo, kii te gip mulki kǝ to yam ka da'a. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ra'untuwo, kup muntu kan pali gam gǝs wule heli nya tuwo, ti ni'e bari gip mulki kǝ to yam ka.<verse eid="MAT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Muntu kup nǝm heli nya wule muntu gip sun gǝno, ami ni tǝ nǝmǝni.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barju ba kem pati asǝm gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luk 17.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Ama muntu kup kem nǝm gip mimir ju kan ngǝsh wur demǝn kǝ pi warwat pitǝno, ar baa mani mbarǝm tu dǝ ɓali ti ghun lu'i bar ɗir yar dǝ la ti su gip dlami bar ɓulaka.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Kashto kǝ mbarǝm den atl kundǝrǝndlip, domici bar ju ba kem mbarǝm kǝ ndetǝno ar womti. Ar nǝm dǝ tǝp kǝ ndetǝn ɗiri, ama kashto kǝ mbarǝm tu kan baa pi tǝp kǝ ndetǝni gwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ra'untuwo, am ko asǝm gi ni ba kem ki kǝ pi warwat pitǝno, tlo kǝ laka. Ar ba mani'i kǝ zam ge mbatl kan ba pa da gwa na am ko asǝm nǝm ko kurkiyi, na dǝ wule la ki te utuka na am gi, ko na asǝm gi kup pa ropi. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ger gi ni ba kem ki kǝ pi warwat pitǝno, ɗǝli kǝ la ka. Ar ba mani'i kǝ zam ge mbatl kan ba pa da gwa na ger nǝm, na dǝ la ki te bom utuka na ger gi kup pa ropi.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tǝm kan jilka gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Ngup kǝn ni, ba kǝ mbur ni ko nǝm gip mimir ju da'a. Domici a yari in'e, mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam mǝn ne ger den wur ra cina dǝ Ban to yamka ko gigasi. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />[Nya mbarǝm sur ni kǝdǝ tǝ ɗǝli munju kan jilka gwa.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kor tǝlankuri jeno wura na ayayi muntu da'a.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Gip shini gino, barǝm gon nǝra na tǝm gǝs hauya nantam (100), kan nǝm ba jilka gip wuro, unun mǝn tǝmi baa piwe? Tii za tǝm hauya wupse na kutl-cet ghwanum juka (99), tǝ ri kǝ ngeni nǝm tu kan jilka gwa bi tlǝdǝr diya? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ti ni tǝ zam tǝm gǝsi ngapo, ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, ti pi ghol mbatl na nǝmi, ar man hauya wupse na kutl-cet ghwanum ju kan jilka da gwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Untu ni pa'e, ndu'i kǝ Ba gin kǝ to yamka ni dǝ nǝm gip heli mimir ju jilka da'a.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne erǝm mǝn kopi den tǝpe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk 17.3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Ya'i ni pi'i wani pitǝno, ri kar ti mol kǝn rop gini kǝ yari ti wani pitǝn gǝsi. Ti ni tǝ kum ki kan tǝ ci atl gamo, kǝ pali ti den tǝp ituwi. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ama ti ni tǝ kumi'i dawo, se kǝ ri na erǝm gon nǝm, ko rop nan ki, kǝ ri ni kar ti esi, domici ko unun yari bi dǝ mbarǝm rop, ko myakano ar dǝmwi. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Ti ni tǝ nge kumi gǝzǝn kawo, ri shirǝmi cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopi. Ti ni ngap tǝ nge kumi domtǝn kǝ mǝn kopiyi kawo, pali tǝ ni wule muntu mom yam da gwa, ko mǝn nǝmi wurpi bomi. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, argon tu kǝ dar bi dene dan kaar atlo, tare dar bi dene wi to yamka, eso argon tu kǝ dar bi dene da'a den kaar atlo, to yam ka ma dar bi dene da'a.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />A yari in muntu esi. Mbarǝm rop gip kǝn den kar atl kǝn ni dar bi den bar kan wu liriwo, Ban kǝ to yamka baa pi wuri. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kup las tu mbarǝm rop, ko myakan dom wur den wi gwanno, ami ra nan wuri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den zher tu nge gaparte kagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Den untuwo, ar ni Bitǝrus ri ngen momi kar Yesu tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, biyi mǝneni a gaparte muntu pim warwat pitǝn kagwawe? Bisi ngingiya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;O'o! Bisi nyingi ni katl da'a, ama nyingi bisi hauya myakan na kutl (70). <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ra untuwo, mulki kǝ Yam nǝra wule gun gon kan ba ndu momi tu kǝ bar kǝ am gǝs kan ra kar zher gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Gip dlǝmiwo, ar ni tǝ zam gon ra kan tǝ kop ti wurpi mǝn nartǝn kan ti mbu ɓatli da'a har tǝ mish gwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Nan mbarǝmi mbu ɓatli dawo, ar ni gunyi wule dǝ wur tika, na gǝr gǝsi, na mimir gǝsi, na argon tu kup tǝ ra nari gwa, kǝdǝ ɓatl asǝm yami. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Ama mbarǝmi ngus cina dǝ gunyi tǝ lir ti tǝ wule, &lt;babomi, te mbatl karka ngapi, aa ɓatl ki kup argon tu kǝ kopǝn gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Ar ni gunyi kum guna kǝ mbarǝmi, kan tǝ yape tika, tǝ wule, dǝ za ti tǝ ndara. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ama nan mbarǝm tu kan gunyi ba kop ti wurpi za lasiwo, ar ni tǝ ri mo na zher berǝm gǝs kan tǝ kop ti wurpi njen hauya nantam gwa. Tǝ nǝm berǝm gǝsi te yarka tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;Ɓatlǝm wurpi tu a kop ki gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Ar ni zher berǝm mbap gǝsi ngus cina da ti tǝ lir ti tǝ wule, &lt;Te mbatl kaarka ngapi, aa ɓatl ki.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ama berǝm gǝs kan ba kop ti wurpiyi kum lirtǝn gǝs da'a. Tǝ kem ba ɓal tika gip bom kǝ moni, se ti ni tǝ ɓatl ti argon tu tǝ kop ti kup kakani. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Nan nami zheri kum argon tu piwo, wu kum tǝmi da'a. Ar ni wu ri kar babom gǝzǝn kan wu yari ti kup argon tu pigwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Ar ni gunyi laa bi zheri tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;Ki zher mǝn ɗasi tu'e! Nan kǝ lirǝmo a yape'i wurpi ju kup kan a kop ki gwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Kiwo, ar ndari kǝ shin guna kǝ berǝm mbap gi kandatu a shin guna gi gwa diya?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Gip lo'o ar ni gunyi kem ba la ti am dǝ mǝn ne ger den bom kǝ moni, dǝ kumi ti dli se ti ni tǝ ɓatl wurpi tu ba kop ti kup kakani. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Untu ni Ban kǝ to yamka baa pi na muntu kup gip kǝn kan nge gaparte esika na mbatl nǝm gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kulci mbarǝm den kari gǝrka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Nan Yesu pa'i yari bar juwo, ar ni tǝ za atl kǝ Galili kan tǝ te gip kǝti atl kǝ Yahuda muntu kan ra te bi ɓula Urdun ka gwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Mbarǝm na womti kop ti kaari, kan tǝ pǝni wur kumi dli gǝzǝnka lasi.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Ar ni mǝn Parise jen ri kar ti kǝ dǝ wu kum kǝ bi gǝsi. Ar ni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa kulci ni'e mbarǝm baa mani kari gǝr gǝs ka den bi argona?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu nǝmi wur, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ zhit ni gip tǝlankur diya? Untun ar ra terka. Yam kan pi wuro tǝ pi wur ni moni na gǝr mǝtli. <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Kan Yam ba wule, &lt;Ra untuwo, mbarǝm baa za bas na naska, tǝ nǝm gǝr gǝsi dlatkǝt, kup gǝzǝn ropiwo wu dǝm dli nǝm ituwi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Kǝkǝno wu rop ni da'a, ama wu dǝm ka dli nǝm wi. Ra untuwo, argon tu Yam gudlumiwo, ba dǝ gon pǝtlka da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ar ni wu ngen momi wu wule,&lt;&lt;Kano unun kem Musa yari'e, mbarǝm baa mani rǝshi tǝlankur kǝ kari gǝr gǝs kawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Musa za kǝn ni kǝ kar gǝr gin ka den bi lati gam gi ni. Ama terkawo untun ar ra da'a. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />A yari inka, muntu kup kar gǝr gǝska, ba'e den warwat pitǝn kǝ muri na moni kaari ni da'a, kan tǝ gudlumi na gono, muri na mǝtli kaari ni tǝ den pi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;O untun fa dlom kǝ gǝr na kos rawo, ar ba mani ba dǝ mbarǝm gudlumi da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba'e Ko gonge mbarǝm ni baa mani pǝni shirǝm tu da'a, ama se mbarǝm ju kan Yam bi wur mani pi untuyi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Domici moni jen ra kan gǝr wur moniyi dagwa, jen ngapo, mbarǝm ni pali wur unju. Jen ngapo gip ndu'i gǝzǝn ni den'e wii gudlumi da'a den bi kǝ mulki kǝ to yam ka. Kup mǝn mani pǝni shirǝm tuwo, tǝ pǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu la'i mimir albarka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Ar ni mbarǝm jen ɗiri mimir jen kar Yesu kǝdǝ tǝ ne am den wuri, tǝ shirǝm na Yam den wuri. Ama mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi matl wuri. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Ama Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Zani dǝ heli mimir ju ɗir karǝmi, ba kǝ hane wur nika da'a! Domici mulki kǝ Yamo gwazin ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ar ni tǝ ne wur am gam tǝ la'i wur albarka, kan tǝ ndara.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗal moni mǝn bar kǝ ame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ar ni mbarǝm gon ɗir kar Yesu tǝ ngen momi kar ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, unu ho bar ni aa pi kǝdǝ a zam ge mbatli kan baa pa dagwa wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule,&lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ ngen momi den ar gontu kan ra hoyi gwawe? Yam nan gǝs ni'e hoyi. Kin kǝ ndu ge mbatl kan baa pa dawo, kop dokayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Kan mbarǝmi ba wule, &lt;&lt;Dokayi gonge?&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, Ba kǝ ri gon eka da'a. Ba kǝ mur na mǝtli kaari da'a. Ba kǝ pi mur da'a. Ba kǝ bi seda kǝ lar da'a. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Bi nartǝn ga bǝba gi na nǝna gi, ndu berǝm dǝmi gi wule gam gi.<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Ɗal moniyi bali ti tǝ wule. &lt;&lt;A kop doka ju wi kup, Unun es sem wi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kin kǝ ndu kǝ nǝra dlato, ri wur bar kǝ am gika kǝ bi wurpiyi munju kan am ri wur kar dagwa, kii zam bar kǝ am to yamka. Kan kǝ ɗir kopǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ama nan ɗal moniyi kum untuwo, ar ni tǝ ndara bom na dun mbatli domici tǝ mǝn bar kǝ am ni hoyi. <verse eid="MAT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Ar ni Yesu wul mir mǝn kulci kar tiyi'e, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, ar ba ban naar dǝ mǝn bar kǝ am te gip mulki kǝ to yam ka.<verse eid="MAT 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />A yari in es'e, ar ba mani dǝ rakumi te tǝp gip ger alura na dǝ mǝn bar kǝ am te gip mulki kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Nan mir mǝn kulci kar ti kum untuwo ar ni wu nǝm bi na ame, wu wule, &lt;&lt;O untu ni fawo, woni baa zam ɗǝltǝn ituwi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Ar ni Yesu zhit wur hoyi kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Gip shini kǝ mbarǝm kamo, ar baa pi da'a. Ama kar Yamo, ko unuwo mǝn pitǝn ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Ar ni Bitǝrus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar tu mǝ za bar gǝmi ka kup mǝ kop ki wi. Unun mii zam gip kopi giwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, ge shirǝmi ni a yari ine, Gip zhan mǝn ɗirtǝno, Nya Mbarǝm ni dǝm den dandi mǝn cirtǝn gip mulki gǝso, kǝn mǝn kopi gǝn baa dǝm den dandi kutl-cet rop, kǝ tloyi gǝs gal kutl-cet rop kǝ Isra'ila shirǝmi. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Kano muntu kup za bom gǝsi, ko mǝn gǝpi gǝs moni, ko mǝtli, ko base, ko nase, ko mimir gǝsi, ko kǝn gǝsi, den bi sun gǝno, tii zam argon tu kan man munju gwa gucǝpi hauya nantam (100), kan tǝ pa zam ge mbatli tu baa pa dagwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ama mbarǝm na womti kan ra cina kǝkǝno, wii dǝm kǝ kaari, kǝ kaar ngapo wii dǝm kǝ cina.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Mǝn mbap gip kǝn inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />&lt;&lt;Mulki kǝ to yam kawo, wule ba mǝn bom gon ni ar ra, kan ɗǝl kǝ bi cigǝni kǝ ngeni munju kan baa pi ti mbap gip kǝn inabi gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Wu dlǝr den tii ɓatl wur den wurpi tu ba ɓatl mǝn mbap kǝ nde pǝt gwa, kan tǝ kar wur rǝn gip kǝn gǝsika. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Bar kǝ gǝlla am ghwanǝm kǝ cigǝni nan tǝ ɗǝlo, ar ni tǝ shin jen dlor katl bi bar pǝte, wu den pi argon da'a. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;Kǝn ma ri ni gip kǝn gǝn kǝ pini mbapi, aa ɓatl kǝn argon tu kup ndari gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ar ni wu ndara gip kǝni. Nan tǝ ɗǝl bar kǝ awa muhka na awa ghwanǝm eso, ar ni tǝ pa pi untu. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Kǝ sit bar kǝ gǝlla am nantamo, ar ni tǝ pa ɗǝl kan tǝ zam jen dlor-dlor, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;Unun kem kǝn ra den dǝmi ɗe katl nde pǝt kup we?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;Murgon ra kan bi mi mbap kǝ pi gwa da'a.&gt; Ar ni ba mǝn kǝni wul wur'e, &lt;Kǝn ma ri pini mbap gip kǝn gǝni.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Kǝ sit shukuto, ar ni ba mǝn kǝni la bi muntu kan ba ne ti ger den kǝni gwa tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;laa bi mǝn mbap ju kǝ ɓatl wuri, pare den muntu ɗir kǝ kaar ar ri den muntu pare ɗirtǝn gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Nan munju yem wur mbap kǝ sit bar kǝ gǝlla am nantami ɗiro, ar ni ko gonge gǝzǝn zam ɓatltǝn gǝs wurpi tu ba ɓatl mǝn mbap kǝ nde pǝt gwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Munju kan ri kǝ pariyi pǝn den'e baa ɓatl wur ar man kǝ nami. Ama ar ni ɓatl wur wurpi tu ba ɓatl mǝn mbap kǝ nde pǝt gwa tangǝn na munju ri kǝ siti gwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Nan wu nǝmo, ar ni wu nǝm ngwartǝn den babomi. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Wu wul ba mǝn kǝni'e, &lt;Munju kǝ yem wur kǝ kaar dami kupo, mbap kǝ awa nǝm ni katl wu pi ama kǝ ɓatl wur tangǝn nam mi, mǝn kan mǝ ndo mi na tle mattǝn kǝ pǝt gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Ama ba mǝn kǝni nǝmi gon gip wur tǝ wule, &lt;Berǝm, a ne'i asǝm gam ka da'a! Mǝ dar ni bi nan kǝn den aa ɓatl ki wurpi tu ba ɓatl mǝn mbap kǝ nde pǝt gwa da'aya? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Nǝm ɓatltǝn gi kǝ ndara. Untun a pǝn tor gip mbatl gǝn den aa ɓatl wur tangǝn nan ki. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />A mani ni pi argon tu a ndu pi na wurpi gǝn gwa diya? Lo ci'i ni den bi am tu a pi gwaya?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Ra untuwo, kǝ cina baa dǝm kǝ kaari, kǝ kaar ngapo wii dǝm kǝ cina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pa shirǝm den kanda kǝ mǝshtǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Nan Yesu den totǝn Urshalimawo, ar ni tǝ laa bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl cet ropi markǝme, kan tǝ wul wur'e, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />&lt;&lt;Ar tu mǝ to ni Urshalima, baa bi Nya mbarǝm am dǝ kiri liɓa kǝ Yam na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa. Wii tloyi ti shirǝm den dǝ ri ti eka. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Wii ta ti am dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. Wii pi ti shirǝm mburtǝne, kan wu ɓo ti, kan wu ɓa tika den kin esi. Ama den pǝt kǝ myakano, baa tli ti na ge mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lirtǝn kǝ nasi ga Yakubu na Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ar ni nasi ga Yakubu na Yohana, mimir kǝ Zabadi, ɗir nan wur kar Yesu, kan tǝ ngus cina da ti tǝ lir ti argoni. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu a pi'iwe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wule. &lt;&lt;Gip mimir gǝn rop juwo, a liri dǝ nǝm dǝm den am shimli gon ngapo den am yali gi gip mulki gi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Ar ni Yesu wul mimiri'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom ar gon tu kǝ liri gwa da'a! Kii mani kumi dli tu kan a ri kǝ kumi gwaya?&gt;&gt; Wu nǝmi ti wu wule. &lt;&lt;An! Mi mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kii mani kumi dli tu kan aa kum gwa, ama dǝmi den am shimli ko am yali gǝno, gwan ni da'a, ban kǝ to yam ka ni kǝrkǝmi munju kan tǝ zǝzari gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Nan nami mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutli kum untuwo, ar ni lo ci wur den yas mbarǝm rop ju. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Ama Yesu la wur bi kup gǝzǝn, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ mom'e gun kǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a ba gode iko den mbarǝm gǝzǝni, eso kiri gǝzǝn ba gode wur iko pa'e. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ama gip kǝno untu ni da'a. Muntu ba ndu dǝmi bariwo, ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ dǝm mǝn pi'in mbapi. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Eso, muntu kup ba ndu dǝmi kǝ cinawo, ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ dǝm zher gini. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Ba'e, Nya mbarǝm sur ni kǝ dǝ mbarǝm pi ti mbap da'a, ama kǝ dǝ tǝ pi mbarǝm ni, kan tǝ bi ge mbatl gǝs es kǝ ɗǝli mbarǝm na womti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabi jen rop zam mani shini bari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Nan Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ba za Yerikowo, ar ni mbarǝm na womti kop ti kaari. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Tabi jen ra rop den dǝmi bi tǝpe. Nan wu kum Yesu den ɗirtǝn den tǝpiwo, ar ni wu tli yar yam wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, Nya Dauda, kum guna gǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Ar ni womti mbarǝmi matl wur kǝ dǝ wu yon shot, ama wu tli yar na nari wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, Nya Dauda kum guna gǝmi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Ar ni Yesu dlǝr tǝ wul wur'e &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu'e a pi inu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, miwo mǝ ndu ni'e mǝ mani shini bari!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Ar ni Yesu kum guna gǝzǝn kan tǝ tabe ger gǝzǝni. Wule gip njipkǝr gere, ar ni wu nǝm shini bari, kan wu kop ti.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu te gip bǝn Urushalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-38">Luk 19.28-38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Nan Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti mbubar nye bǝn gon'e Betafaji kan ra den tlǝndǝr kin zaitun kosak na Urshalimawo, ar ni Yesu kar mir mǝn kulci gǝs rop. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Te ni gip nye bǝn tu kan ra cina da in gwa, na tetǝn gini, ki zam bar kǝm gon ra na ɓali na nya gǝs kar ti. Pǝtl wur ni kǝ terim ni. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Muntu kup pi in shirǝmo, wul ti ni'e, &lt;Babom ni ba ndu'i.&gt; Ti kar bar nan wur na zhotǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Muntu pi ni dlat na ar gon tu mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam yari gwa'e. <verse eid="MAT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />&lt;&lt;Yari ni mbarǝm kǝ sihiyona'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">&lt;Shin ni, gun gin tu den ɗirtǝne.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Tǝ mǝn giɓǝr gam ni da'a, tǝ ra den bar kǝme, tǝ den desi den nye bar kǝme.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti ri kan wu pi kandatu Yesu yari wur gwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Wu ɗiri nas jakiyi na nya gǝsi, kan wu la ga tutul dli gǝzǝn den nya bar kǝmi, kan tǝ to dǝm dene. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mbarǝm na womti ni wi tutul dli gǝzǝn den tǝpe, jen ngapo am kin dabinoni wu wotl kan wu la den tǝpi. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Ar ni womti mbarǝm ju kan den ritǝn cina dati, na munju kan ra kar dati, tli yar wu den wultǝn'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Hosana dǝ nya Dauda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Albarka ra den muntu kan ɗir gip sun kǝ Babom gwa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">&lt;&lt;Hosana to yam ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Nan Yesu to gip bǝn Urushalima wo, arni bǝni guzǝlka, wu den wultǝn'e. Woni'e muntuwe? <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Ar ni womti mbarǝmi nǝmi wur wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yesu ni'e muntu, mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni kan ɗǝl ter Nazarat kan gip atl kǝ Galili gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kar mǝn wuri na wuri ka gip bom kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Ar ni Yesu te gip bom kǝ Yam, kan tǝ kaar mǝn wuri na wurika. Tǝ gyas tebǝr kǝ mǝn sanje wurpi na ba dǝmi kǝ munju ba wur kuɓǝr ka gwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Na rǝshi ni ar ra, &lt;Bom gǝn ba dǝm las tu ba shirǝm na Yam gwa,&gt; ama kǝ pali kawi wule ba dǝmi kǝ mǝn tare guntǝpe!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ar ni ga tabi na ga kurki ɗir kar ti gip bom kǝ Yami, kan tǝ warke wuri. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ama nan kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa, shin bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn ju, na kumi mimir gip Bom kǝ Yam den tli yar wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Hosana dǝ nya Dauda&gt;&gt; Ar ni lo ci wuri. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Wu wul ti'e, kǝ kumni bar ju mimir ba yari gwa diya? &lt;&lt;Aan,&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi wur untu. &lt;&lt;Kǝ zhit ni gip tǝlan kuri diya? Las tu kan yari'e, ki ni kǝ kulci mimir na mǝn tle nyin den wu ɗǝɗa ki gwa diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Ar ni Yesu za wur tǝ ɗǝl gǝs gip bǝni tǝ ndara Betanya, tǝ mur teka.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pi bi kin turume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar 11.12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Kǝ bi cigǝni nan Yesu ba pal su bǝn kǝ Urushalima kawo, ar ni tǝ kum guzumi. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Kan tǝ shin kin turum den bi tǝpe. Nan tǝ te kariwo tǝ zam gǝri nyeni dene da'a, wol ni katl. Ar ni tǝ wul kini'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ'i gǝr da'a!&gt;&gt; Na yari untuwo, ar ni kin turumi konka. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Nan mir mǝn kulci kar ti shin untuwo, ar ni wu nǝm bi na ame wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kin turum kǝn konka bǝle-bǝle untu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A yari in ge shirǝmi, kǝn nǝra na ngǝshtǝn den Yam kan kǝ pi shakka dawo, ba'e argon tu pi kin turum tu katl ni ki pi da'a. Ama ki mani wuli tlǝndǝr tu'e, &lt;Tli bar tu kǝ nda su gip bar ɓulaka,&gt; Ar baa dǝmi in untu. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Kǝn ni kǝ nǝm tor gip mbatl gino, kii zam argon tu kup kǝ liri gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nge nǝmi bar ju Yesu ba pi gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Nan Yesu te gip Bom kǝ Yami tǝ den kulci mbarǝmo, ar ni kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri yam na kiri kǝ bǝn ɗir kar ti, wu ngen momi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Bar ju kan kǝ den piwo na ikoyi gongen kǝ pi? Woni bi'i, biyiwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ma aa ngen momi kar kǝne. Kǝn ni kǝ manim bali argon tu a ngen momi kar kǝno,&gt;&gt; A yari in na ko unu ikoyi ni a pi bar ju. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />O Yohanawo, na unu ikoyin tǝ pi batisma, na iko kǝ Yam na ko kǝ mbarǝm ni? Ar ni wu bali gip dlom gǝzǝn wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ni mǝ wule sur yam ni ar ɗǝlo, ti wule, unun kem mǝ nǝm ti tor gip mbatl gǝmi dawu? <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ama mǝn ni mǝ wule kǝ mbarǝm no, mǝ kum bǝrti kǝ mbarǝme. Domici mbarǝm mom'e Yohanawo mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ mom da'a.&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu nǝm tǝ wul wur'e untu no, &lt;&lt;Ami ma, A yari in na unu ikon a pi bar ju da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den mbarǝm mǝn mimir rop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />&lt;&lt;Unun kǝ dami we? Mbarǝm gon ra mǝn mimir moni rop. Tǝ ri kar kǝ pariyi tǝ wule, &lt;Nya gǝni sekǝno ri pi mbap gip kǝn inabi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Ama nyayi nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;O'o, aa zam ritǝn da'a.&gt; Ama den kaari nan tǝ dam tiwo ar ni tǝ ri. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Kan bǝbayi ba ri kar nye gǝpi tǝ yari ti untu pa'e, nyayi ba nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;Aan ari bǝba.&gt; Ama tǝ ri da'a. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Gip mimir rop juwo, gonge ni kop shirǝm kǝ bazin we?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nye kǝ pariyi ni,&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, A yari in ge shirǝmi, mǝn nǝmi wurpi bomi na mǝn bi gǝs kaari ba ɓotl ka den kǝn kǝ ba tetǝn gip mulki kǝ Yami. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Domici Yohana ɗir gode in guntǝp kǝ pitǝn dlat, ama kǝ nǝm tor gip mbatl gin da'a, ama mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na mǝn bi gǝs kaariwo wu nǝmi. Ama kup na kǝ shin bar juwo, kǝ ci atl gam kǝ ngǝsh den ti da'a.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm kǝ mǝn kori bar ju kan nǝm kǝn inabi gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Kum ni shirǝm gon esi, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kǝn gon ra kan ngani kǝn gǝs gwa. Ar ni tǝ gandǝlika na panye, kan tǝ bor ba zho'i mal kin inabi, tǝ pa tu kupshi kǝ mǝn ɓuti kǝni. Ar ni tǝ bi mǝn kori bar jen kǝni kǝdǝ wu ɓom dene, kan tǝ ndara gip bǝn goni. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Nan wokoci rǝshi kǝni ɗiro, ar ni ba mǝn kǝni kar zher gǝs wu ri kar mǝn kori kǝni, den'e wu bi ti argon tu ndari dǝ bi ti gip gǝri kin inabiyi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Ama ar ni munju kan nǝm kǝni kǝ dǝ wu ɓom dene nǝm zher gǝsi, wu ɓo nǝm, wu ri gon eka, kan wu pi ta la'i gon na tate. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Kan tǝ kar zheri jen es kan womti man kǝ pari gwa, ar ni mǝn ɓomi den kǝni pi wur untu pa'e. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Den kariwo, ar ni tǝ kar nya gǝsi, tǝ wule, &lt;Wi shin nartǝn kǝ nya gǝni.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Ama nan mǝn kori kǝni shin nyayiwo, ar ni wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;Nya tu kan kǝni ba dǝm gwas gwan tu den ɗirtǝne. Ɗir ni mǝ ritǝni eka dǝ kǝni dǝmi mi ra!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ar ni wu nǝm ti, kan wu byal ti kaar kǝni, wu ri ti eka. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Ra untuwo, mǝn bas kǝnin palo, unun ti pii mǝn ɓomi den kǝniwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ti la mǝn ɗasi tu ju gip dun mǝshtǝni, kan tǝ nǝm kǝni ka tǝ bi munju kan baa bi ti argon tu ndari, wini wu rǝsh gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ tabe ni zhǝti gip tǝlankur kǝ Yam diya?</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="MAT 21:42">&lt;Tat tu kan mǝn tu'i bom ngewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">ar ni dǝm tat tu kan man ko gonge tat tu'i bomi gwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Muntuwo, pi kǝ Babom ni, eso bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am ni kar mi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Ra untuwo, a yari ine, mulki kǝ Yamo, baa zote ka kar kǝne, dǝ bi mbarǝm jeni kan ba pi ho bar gwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Muntu kan kup nda den tat tu, ti cen ka kucil-kucil, ama muntu tati nda den tiwo ar ba lu tika.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Nan kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn Parise, kum argon tu Yesu yariwo, ar ni wu momka'e, den wurni tǝ den shirǝmi. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Ar ni wu ngen tǝp kǝ nǝmi gǝsi, ama bǝrti ci wurka den womti mbarǝmi, domici wu mom'e Yesuwo mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den nyel kǝ gudlumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu pa shirǝm nan wur na misali tǝ wule. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />&lt;&lt;Mulki kǝ to yam ka nǝra wule gun gon kan ne nyel gudlumi kǝ nya gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Tǝ kar zher gǝs dǝ la bi munju tǝ ngen wur kǝ dǝ wu ɗir kǝba nyeli gwa. Ama wu nge ɗirtǝnka. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Tǝ pa kar zher gǝs jen tǝ wule, &lt;Yari ni munju a ngen wur kǝ dǝ wu ɗir kǝba nyeli gwa'e, a pi fingal wi, kan a mbosh tla gi kǝn na tla ju kan ket wur gwa wi, ko unu ra mak wi. Ɗir ni kǝba nyeli!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ama mǝn dǝkiyi nge kumika, kan wu ndara won gǝzǝni, gon ba ndara gip kǝn gǝsi gon ngapo kǝba bar pǝt gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Jen ngapo wu nǝm mir zher gǝsi, wu ɓo wuri, kan wu ri wur eka. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Ar ni lo ci gunyi hoyi, kan tǝ kar mǝn bi'utu gǝs wu ri wur eka, kan wu keri bǝn gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Kan tǝ wul ga zher gǝsi'e &lt;Pa'i ko unu kǝ nyeli wi, ama mǝn dǝki ju kan a ngen wur kǝ ba nyeliwo, wu ndari da'a. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Ra'untuwo, kop ni guntǝp-guntǝpe kǝ la ni bi muntu kup kǝ shin ti gwa tǝ ɗir kǝ ba nyeli.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Ar ni zher gǝsi kop bi guntǝp-guntǝpi, wu la bi mbarǝm ju wu zam wur gwa, hoyi na bes mbarǝme, kan ba nyeli ba laa'i na mǝn dǝki. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Nan gunyi ɗir kǝ shini ba nyeliwo, ar ni tǝ shin mbarǝm gon kan la tutul dli kǝ nyeli da gwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Ar ni tǝ wul mbarǝmi'e &lt;Berǝm, imnu pi kan kǝ ɗir ɗe bat na tutul dli kǝ nyeli we?&gt; Ama mbarǝmi mom argon tu ti bali ti gwa da'a. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Ar ni gunyi wul mǝn mbap gǝsi'e &lt;ɓal ni mbarǝmika am na asǝme, kǝ la ti ni te gip dun las tuka, las tu ba kul na ngasi kur bi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Munju la wur biwo na womti ni wura, ama munju zǝzariwo njem ni.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngeni momi den ɓatli wurpi bom dǝ Kaisar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Ar ni mǝn Parise ri mo gam wu dam wur den kandatu wi nǝm Yesu den shirǝm gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ar ni wu kar mir mǝn kulci kar wur na mbarǝm kǝ Hiridus jen wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mǝ mom'e ki mǝn pitǝn dlat ni. Kǝ kulci mbarǝm guntǝp kǝ Yami. Kano kǝ pǝn mbarǝm kup nǝm ni kar ki. Eso kǝ pǝn den mbarǝm gon ra kan man gon gwa da'a. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Kǝkǝno yari mi, ar mbun'e dǝ ɓatl wurpi bom dǝ Kaisar gomna kǝ Romaya, ko ar ndari da'a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ama nan Yesu mom damtǝn kǝ ɗasi tu gǝzǝn kawo, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e &lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn se mbarǝme! Unun kem kǝ ndu kǝ godem we? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Godem ni wurpi tu kan ba ɓatl wurpi bomi na ri gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu ɗiri ti dinari, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Shishidǝr na sun kǝ woni den dinariyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;kǝ Kaisar ni.&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Bi ni Kaisar argon tu kan kǝ Kaisar ni gwa, kan kǝ pa bi ni Yam argon tu kan kǝ Yam ni gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Nan wu kum utuwo, ar ni wu nǝm bi na am wu za ti kan wu ndara.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngeni momi den tlitǝn gip mǝshi mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Gasiwo, ar ni mǝn Sadukiya jen munju ba wule tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝm ra da'a, ɗir kar Yesu, wu ngen momi kar ti, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />wu wule &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci! Musa wule, &lt;Mbarǝm ni zam gǝri na gǝr gǝs da'a kan tǝ mǝsh kawo, esi baa mani gudlumi na gǝri kǝ dǝ tǝ zami mǝn bari gǝs mimiri.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Yas mbarǝm jen ra nyingi gip mi mǝn gǝpi na mǝn bari, bari gǝzǝn gudlumi na gǝre, tǝ mǝshka tǝ zam nya da'a tǝ za'i muntu ba kop ti gwa gǝri. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Untu ni pi na kǝ rop na kǝ myakan bari nǝm kǝ nyingiyi. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Den kaariwo ar ni gǝri mǝshka. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Yari mi. Gǝri baa dǝm kǝ woni gas tu mǝshi mbarǝm baa tli gwa we? Domici tǝ gudlumi na kup nyingiyi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;kǝ jilka wi, domici kǝ mom shirǝm kǝ Yam da'a, eso kǝ mom iko kǝ Yam da'a. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Gas tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝmo, gudlumi ra da'a. Mbarǝm ba nǝra wule mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam to yamka. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Eso, den tlitǝn kǝ mǝshi mbarǝm gip gam bǝci'o, kǝ zhit ni argon tu Yam yari'in gwa diya? Ar ra na rǝshi'e, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />&lt;Ami ni'e muntu kan Ibǝrahim na Ishaku na Yakubu ba bote ti gwa.&gt; Tiwo mǝshi mbarǝm ni ba bote ti da'a ama mǝn ge mbatl ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Nan mbarǝm kum untuwo, ar ni wu nǝm bi na am den kulci gǝsi.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Doka tu kan naar mani gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ama nan mǝn Parise kum Yesu ngub bi kǝ mǝn Sadukiyawo, ar ni wu dom wuri. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Gon gip wur mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa, gode Yesu na ngeni momi. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />Tǝ wul Yesu'e &lt;&lt;Mǝn kulci, dokayi gonge ni mani nartǝn kup gip tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt; &lt;Ndu Babom Yam gi na mbatl gi kup na ge mbatl gi kup na damtǝn gi kup.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Muntu ni'e doka kǝ pari eso, tin tǝ nar mani. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Kǝ ropiwo, ar ni ra wule mǝntayi, kǝ ndu berǝm dǝmi gi wule gam gi. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kup den doka rop ju ni ar ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngeni momi den Almasihu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Nan mǝn Parise dom wur kǝ ba lasi nǝmo, ar ni Yesu ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Ununu'e, damtǝn gin den Almasihu we? Tǝ gǝs gal kǝ woni?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝ gǝs gal kǝ Dauda ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kan imnu, Dauda tǝp kǝba iko kǝ Ruhu ba la ti bi'e, Babom gǝnu? Domici Dauda wule, <verse eid="MAT 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />&lt;Babom wul Babom gǝn'e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Dǝm den am shimli gǝni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">se, amin, a pali mǝn gapa nan ki atli dǝ asǝm gǝ.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Tun kan Dauda la ti bi'e Babomo, Imnu Almasihu ba dǝm gǝs gal gǝs we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Ko nǝm gon ra gip wur kan mani ti bali gwa da'a. Gasi ar ri cinawo murgon ra kan'i ngen momi kar ti gwa da'a.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu pallase mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12.38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-52">Luk 11.37-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Nan mbarǝm dom wur na womti na mir mǝn kulci kar tiwo, ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />&lt;&lt;Mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise ni bi wur mani bali tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ra'untuwo, pi ni argon tu kup wu kulci in gwa kǝ kop ni esi. Ama ba kǝ kop ni argon tu wu pi gwa da'a. Domici wu pi argon tu wu kulci gwa da'a. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Wu ɓali mbarǝm gosgam mǝn giɓǝrtǝn hoyi wu ne wur den bibyala, wu ngapo wu ne wur am ra gip pǝni da'a ko nya yasa nǝm. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Kup argon tu wu piwo kǝ dǝ mbarǝm shin ni katl. Wu gucip mir tǝlankur kan rǝsh shirǝm kǝ Yam gipi gwa wu ɓal den goshi gǝzǝni, na la'i tlyari zare den bi lulur gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Eso wu ndu'e dǝ bi wur ba dǝmi kǝ kiri kǝba nyele, na ba dǝmi tu kan mbun mani gwa gip bom domtǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Wu ndu dǝ shirmi wur kǝ ba domtǝn kǝ mbarǝm ko gigasi, dǝ wul wur'e &lt;mǝn Kulci.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ama kǝno ba dǝ la kǝn ni bi, &lt;Mǝn kulci da'a.&gt; Domici mǝn kulci gino nǝm ni, kan kup gin eso kǝn yas ni. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Ba kǝ la ni bi murgon'e, &lt;Bǝba&gt; Den kar atl da'a, domici bǝba nǝm ni ne ine muntu kan ra to yamka gwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Ba kǝ zani dǝ gon lakǝn bi'e, &lt;Mǝn cina da'a&gt; domici mǝn cinayo nǝm ni, ti ni'e Almasihu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Bari gip kǝno ti ni tii dǝm mǝn pi'in mbapi. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Muntu kup ɗǝɗa gam gǝso baa pali ti atli, kano muntu pali gam gǝs atli ngapo baa ɗǝɗa ti.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Ama kashto gi ni kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise. Mǝn pi tǝn wule ho mbarǝme! Kǝ le bǝdlabǝn tetǝn gip mulki kǝ to yamka, kǝn na gam gin ngapo kǝ te gipi da'a, eso mǝn ndu'i tetǝn ngapo kǝ hane wur ka. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />[Kashto gi ni kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise Mǝn pi tǝn wule ho mbarǝme! Kǝ zup ka den bar kǝ am kǝ mǝtli jukan moni gǝzǝn mǝshka gwa, eso kǝ pi tlyari shǝrǝm na Yam kǝ dǝ shin kǝn ra, ra untuwo, baa hukunte in hoyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tǝlankuri jeno wura na ayayi muntu da'a.</char></note>]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Kashto gi ni kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise. Mǝn pitǝn wule ho mbarǝme! Domici kǝ jikat bar ɓula kǝ ri atl tu kan ra na dlyami kǝ ngeni mǝn ci atl gam nǝm. Kǝn ni kǝ zam ngapo, kǝ pali ti nye mǝn bom utu gucipi rop ar man kandatu kǝn ra gwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Kashto gi ni kǝn tabi mbarǝm mǝn kopi na mbarǝme! Kǝ wule &lt;Argon ni da'a, dǝ ɓo am atl na bom kǝ Yami, ama murgon tu ɓo am atl na zǝnariya kan te gip bom kǝ Yam kawo, Kǝ wule ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ pi argon tu tǝ ɓo am atli deni gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Kǝn kǝdlǝm tabi! Gongen naar mani, zinariya na, ko bom kǝ Yam kan pash zinariyayi gwa ni? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kǝ wul es'e, &lt;kup muntu ɓo am atl na bagadiwo, argon ni da'a. Ama muntu kan ɓo am atl na wurpi kan bi den bagadiwo, ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ pi argon tu tǝ ɓo am atli dene gwa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Kǝn ga tabi! Gonge ni'e bari, bar ju bi den bagadiyi gwa na, ko bagadi tu kan ba pash bar ju bi den bagadiyi gwa ni? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ra untuwo muntu kup ɓo am atl na bagadiwo, tǝ ɓoni am atl nari na kup argon tu kan ra dene gwa ituwi. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Eso muntu kup ɓo am atl na bom kǝ yamo, tǝ ɓo ni am atl nari na Yam muntu ba dǝm gip bomi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Muntu kup ɓo am atl na to yam ka wo, tǝ ɓo ni am atl na dandi kǝ Yami na Yam kan ba dǝm den dandiyi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Kashto gi ni kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci den kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise. Mǝn pitǝn wule ho mbarǝme! Kǝ bi zakka kǝ ɗapti borkono na kǝ woli, ama kǝ za kiri zo bar ju tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa yari dǝ pi kagwa, wi ni'e, pi ge shirǝmi, shini guna'i, na aminci. Munju ni ndari dǝ pi, bat na za'i nami ka. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Kǝn tabi mǝn kopi na mbarǝme, kǝ cica ga salǝm ka gip mal tle gi ni, ama kǝ zhinge Rakumi.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Kashto gi ni, kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise. Mǝn pitǝn wule ho mbarǝme! Kǝ mani ho'i kaar galka na gal kini, ama gipiwo laa'i ni ar ra na wani pitǝn kǝ cucetǝne na ndu'i gami. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Ki tabi mǝn Parise! Ho gip wuromal na gip galkini kakani kan dǝ kaar gǝzǝn mbuni. <verse eid="MAT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Kashto gi ni kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise. Mǝn pi tǝn wule ho mbarǝme! Kǝn nǝra wule gambici tu kan zapi kaari na ghol atl kan ba shin mbutǝn gǝs gwa, ama gipiwo, gul kǝ mǝshi mbarǝm ni, na ko unu ndotti. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Untu ni kǝn ra, Kariwo ba shin kǝn wule kǝn mǝn pitǝn dlat ni ama gipiwo, kǝn ra laa'i na setǝne na nge kopi doka. <verse eid="MAT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Kashto gi ni kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na mǝn Parise. Mǝn pi tǝn wule ho mbarǝme! Kǝ tu gam bǝci kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami, kǝ kem dǝ gambici kǝ mǝn pitǝn dlat mbuni. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Kǝ wule, mǝn nǝra far na ga kori gǝmiwo, na mii ngash gam nan wur gip ri mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam eka da'a. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Untuni gode'e kǝn gǝsgal kǝ munju kan ri mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam eka gwa ni. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Ra untuwo ci ni cina kǝ pa'i ni warwat pitǝn ju, ga kori gin la gǝsi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Kǝn ga ici'e, ga badǝr kǝ wonzi! Imnu kii ɗǝli gam ginka gip hukuntetǝn kǝ bom utuwe? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ra'untuni, a kari in bar na mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami, na mǝn bopya, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm tǝlankur kulci kǝ doka kǝ Musa. Kii ri jen eka na ɓa'i gǝzǝn den kini, jen eso kii ɓo wur na rǝɓa'e kǝba domtǝn gi ni na kopi jen bǝn-bǝni, kǝn den kumi wur dli. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Aa kar wur ni ɗir kǝ dǝ bǝran kǝ mǝn pitǝn dlat ju kan ri wur eka gwa ni den gam gini, wule ga Habila mǝn pitǝn dlat na Zakariya nya Barakiya muntu kǝ ri ti eka gip dlom bom kǝ Yam na ba keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />A yari in ge shirǝmi, bar ju kup baa zam ni mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuli Urushalima gami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34">Luk 13.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Kǝn mǝn Urushalima, mǝn Urushalima! Kǝn mǝn ri mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam eka, na la'i munju kan kar wur kar kǝn na tat gwa! Biyi mǝne ni a ndu domi mimir gin wule, kandatu nas kor ba dom mimir gǝs kan tǝ ghum wur ka na bibako gǝsi gwa, ama kǝ ndu untu da'a. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ar tu bom gin i na mur gon da'a. Ar dǝm kawi koni. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />A yari'in ka, ki'i shimǝn da'a, se kǝn ni kǝ wule, &lt;Mǝn albarka ni muntu ba ɗir gip sun kǝ Babom gwa!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu yari kanda tu ba yas bom kǝ yam kagwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mar 13.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luk 21.5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Nan Yesu za Bom kǝ Yamiwo, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti gode ti kanda kǝ bom ju kan ra gip Bom kǝ Yami. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Ama tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shin Bom tu kan tu gwaya? A yari ine tat gon ra kan baa sa den gon gwa da'a. Baa yasi ka kup.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Halama kǝ patǝn kǝ zhan kup</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Nan Yesu ra njon den tlǝndǝr mǝn kin Zaituno, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti ɗir kar ti mol, wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yari mi, gigasi ni bar ju ba pi, kano ununu'e, halama kǝ paltǝn gi sur na kǝ patǝn kǝ zhan kup we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;dǝm ni gǝɗǝn, ba dǝ murgon jǝli in nika da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Domici mbarǝm na womti baa ɗir gip sun gǝni, wu wul kǝn'e, &lt;Ami ni'e Almasihuyi.&gt; Na untun wi jǝli mbarǝm ka na womti. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Kii kum tlitǝn kǝ dlan na Shirǝm tlitǝn kǝ dlan na womti, ama badǝ bǝrti ci in ni da'a. Aan, ar nǝm dǝ bar ju pi, ama patǝn kǝ zhan kupi ɗirwi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Atl ba tli atli gon gami, kan dǝ mbarǝm kǝ gun gon tli mbarǝm kǝ gunyi gon gami. Ba pi guzum na jirkǝttǝn kǝ atl kǝ ba las na womti. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Munju kupo, pare kumi dli kǝ mǝn gǝri nya ni.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Baa bi in ka am dǝ mbarǝm dǝ kumi in dli, wu ri in eka. Baa nge in gip atl kup den bi sun gǝni. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Wokociyi ni, ngǝshtǝn den Yam kǝ mbarǝm na womti ba iɗaka, kan wu bi ezǝn ka, wu nge ezǝn esi. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Eso mǝn lar yari shirǝm kǝ Yam baa cwati, kan wu jǝli mbarǝmka na womti. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Domici kǝ nartǝn kǝ ɗasi tu'o, ndutǝn kǝ mbarǝm na womti baa iɗaka. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ama muntu kan ɓa mbatl dlom gam ar ri patǝn kǝ bar kupo, baa ɗǝli ti. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Baa pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm kǝ mulki kǝ to yamka gip atl kundǝrǝndlip den bi seda dǝ mbarǝm kǝ atl kup, kan dǝ patǝn kǝ bar kupi i ɗiri.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bar kǝ bǝrti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Kǝn ni kǝ shin bar kǝ dǝɗan kan ba kem mǝshtǝn, muntu kan mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Daniel yari gwa ra kǝba las mǝn Tsarkiwo, naa dǝ mǝn zhǝti tǝlan kuri momi! <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Munju kan ra gip kǝti atl kǝ Yahudawo, wu kǝtǝr wu to gǝzǝn gip tlǝndǝre. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Muntu kan ra to kush kǝ yami kawo, ba tǝ ɗǝl sur tǝ ngen tetǝn kǝ pǝni ar gon gip bomi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Muntu kan ra rǝn gip kǝn kawo, ba tǝ pal rǝn bom ka kǝ pǝni tutul ghumtǝn gǝs da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Kashto kǝ mǝtli mǝn tu'e, na munju kan den bii mimir nyin gip wokoci ta gwa! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Shirǝm ni na Yam badǝ kǝtǝr tu ɗiri in ni gip watlǝn, ko den pǝt shukutǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Domici wokociyiwo, baa kum dli hoyi muntu kan tabe pi da'a na ne gǝs kǝ pi atl ar ɗir sekǝni. Eso, baa i pi badǝr kumi dli tu da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />E dǝ wule cani muri juka dawo, na nya mbarǝm gon ra kan baa zam ɗǝltǝn gwa da'a. Ama domici kǝ munju kan Yam zǝzari wo, ba ca muri kǝ kumi dliyi ka.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Wokociyiwo, gon ni wul kǝn'e, &lt;Shin ni, Almasihun kǝni!&gt; Ko, &lt;Tin ta!&gt; Ba kǝ nǝm ni da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Domici ga Almasihu kǝ lar na ga mǝn lar yari shirǝm kǝ Yam baa cwati, kan wu pi bar kǝ nǝmi bi na am na bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝne. Kǝdǝ ar ni baa piwo, wu jǝli munju kan ma zǝzari ni gwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Kum ni, A yari in wi bǝle-bǝle. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Ra'untuwo, murgon ni wul kǝn'e, &lt;Tin ta, gip lǝpe,&gt; ba kǝ ɗǝlni rǝnka da'a. Ko tǝ wule, &lt;Almasihu yin ta na ghuuni te kushi ka,&gt; ba kǝ nǝm ni da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kandatu cirtǝn kǝ cibi kǝ Yam ba ɗǝl gabǝs ar to yamma wo, untu ni paltǝn kǝ Nya mbarǝm baa nǝra. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Las tu mǝshi bar rawo, lasini zhipki ba dom wuri.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paltǝn kǝ nya mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Na patǝn kǝ muri kǝ kumi dli juwo,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="MAT 24:29">Pǝt baa palka dǝmǝni, kan dǝ kyar nge cirtǝnka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">Ga zǝnges ba ro sur yamka, kan dǝ jǝrkǝt bar mǝn iko kǝ to yam ka.<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Wokociyi ni baa shin halama kǝ Nya mbarǝm ɗǝl to dlom yam ka, kan dǝ mbarǝm kǝ atl kup pi kulu keti. Wi shin surtǝn kǝ Nya mbarǝm gip dun yami, na iko, na ɗǝɗatǝn mǝn nartǝni. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Tii kar mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ yam na hori nyo mǝn larǝmtǝn hoyi, kan wu dom munju kan zǝzar wur gwa, gip kǝti wupse kǝ atl kundǝrǝndlip.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulci den kin turume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Kulci ni den kin turume. Kǝn ni kǝ shin am kini sanje ka kan ba pare gilitǝno, kǝ mom'e watlǝn mbira kosak ituwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Untu ni es, kǝn ni kǝ shin bar ju den pitǝno, mom ni'e wokociyi mbira wi kosak, ar mbi bǝdlabǝn wi. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari in'e, mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn baa mǝshka da'a, se bar ju ni kup piwi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Yam na atl baa paka, ama shirǝm gǝn baa paka da'a.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murgon ra kan mom pǝti gwa da'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Murgon ra kan mom pǝti ko awayi gwa da'a, ko mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam to yamka, ko Nyayi, ama Bǝbayi ni katl momi. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Wule kandatu ar pi gip wokaci kǝ Nuhu gwa, untun baa pi wokoci tu Nya mbarǝm ba sur gwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Wule gip muri ja, kapǝn bar ghon kan sar ko-unuka den kaar atlo, mbarǝm ra den ci na tle, moni den gudlumi, kan den ri mir mǝtlika gip kushi, ar ba ri gas tu kan Nuhu to gip Kungǝlǝn jikat mali gwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Mbarǝmi mom argon tu bari kǝ pitǝn gwa da'a, ar ni mal kos den wur kan ba sar wurka kup. Untun paltǝn kǝ Nya mbarǝm baa nǝra. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Wokoci tawo mbarǝm rop baa nǝra den mbap gip kǝne, baa pǝn nǝmka, dǝ za nǝmi. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Mǝtli rop baa nǝra den lu'i bari den ghuni, baa pǝn nǝmka dǝ za nǝmi.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Ra'untuwo, dǝm ni gǝɗǝn, domici kǝ mom pǝt tu kan Babom gin baa sur gwa da'a. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Ama mom ni muntu, dǝ wule babom baa mom wokoci tu mur baa te ti gip bom gip gaso, na tii dǝm gǝɗǝn, tǝ hane muri tetǝn gip bom gǝsika. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ra'untuwo, kǝn ma dlǝr ni gǝɗǝn, domici Nya mbarǝm baa sur ni wokoci tu kǝ mom da gwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zher mǝn aminci na muntu ra na aminci dagwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:35-48">Luk 12.35-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Wo ni'e zher mǝn aminci na bopya, muntu kan babom gǝs ne ti gam bom gǝsi, kǝ dǝ tǝ bi nami zheri fingal den wokoci tu ar ndari gwawe? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ar ba mbuni zhertu kan Babom gǝs pal kan tǝ zam ti tǝ den pi mbap gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, babomi baa ne ti den gam kǝ bar ju kup tǝra nari gwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ama zheri ni dǝm mǝn wani pitǝno, kan tǝ wul gam gǝs'e, &lt;Babom gǝn baa pal bǝle da'a,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />kan tǝ nda gip ezǝn zheri na ɓe, tǝ den ci na tle na mǝn tle ɗu'e. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Babom kǝ zher tu ba pal bat na momi kǝ zheri, den pǝt na awa tu kan tǝ mom da gwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Babomi ba ɓo zheri hoyi, kan tǝ hukunte ti na mǝn setǝne. Lasi ni baa kul na ngasi kur bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den mir mǝtli kutl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />&lt;&lt;Wokoci tawo, mulki kǝ to yamka baa nǝra wule mir mǝtli kutl kan yem pǝtǝla gǝzǝn ba ri kǝ mbori ba mǝn gudlumi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Nantam gip wuro, kǝdlǝm ni, nantam ngapo mǝn bopya ni. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Nantami kan kǝdlǝmno wu pǝn pǝtǝla gǝzǝni, ama wu pǝn mir es kǝ mbǝli ra den kǝ gip pǝtǝla gǝzǝni da'a. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Ama nantam mǝn bopya juwo, kan wu pǝn pǝtǝla gǝzǝni na mir es kǝ mbǝli ra gip mbun leti. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ama nan ba mǝn gudlumiyi cwat bǝle dawo, ar ni kup gǝzǝn umur ghun wur kan wu nde umurka. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Gip dlom gaso, ar ni wu kum latǝn bi den'e, &lt;Ba mǝn gudlumiyi mbirawi! Ɗir mbor tǝni!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Ar ni kup mir mǝtli kutli tlyam wu nǝm kǝrkǝm pǝtǝla gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Kan kǝdlǝmi ba wul mir mǝn bopyayi'e, &lt;Mbǝli mi ni mir gin ngapi, domici pǝtǝla gǝmi den mǝshtǝnkawi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Ar ni mir mǝn bopyayi nǝmi wur wu wule, &lt;O'o, ar baa kǝm mi nan kǝn da'a. Rǝni gip bǝn las tu ba wur mir kagwa, kǝ wur ni.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ama nan wu ra den tǝp ritǝn kǝ wuri miriwo, ar ni ba mǝn gudlumiyi cwati. Mir mǝtli ju kan ra gǝɗǝnwo, ar ni wu te kǝ ba nyel gudlumiyi nan ti, kan ba le bǝdlabǝn ka. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Den kariwo, ar ni nami mir mǝtliyi pal ɗir wu wule, &lt;Babomi! Babomi! Ɓuli mi bǝdlabǝni!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Ama tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;Na ho bi ni a yari in'e, a mom kǝn da'a.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Ra'untuwo, dǝm ni gǝɗǝn, domici kǝ mom pǝti ko wokociyi da'a.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den talanti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Eso mulki kǝ to yamka baa nǝra wule mbarǝm tu kan bari kǝ ɓomi asǝm gwa, kan tǝ la bi ga zher gǝs tǝ ne wur den gam bar gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Tǝ bi nǝm talanti nantam, gon ngapo talanti rop, kan nǝmiwo, talanti nǝm. Tǝ bi ni ko gonge den bi argon tu ti mani pi gwa. Kan tǝ nǝm tǝp tǝ ndara. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Muntu kan bi ti talanti nantamiwo, ar ni tǝ ri ci bar pǝte kan tǝ zam talanti nantam ra deni. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Untu es muntu nǝm talanti ropi, tǝ ri ci bar pǝte, kan tǝ zam talanti rop ra deni. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ama muntu kan nǝm talanti nǝmiwo, ar ni tǝ ri bor shu gip atli kan tǝ ghundǝr wurpi kǝ babom gǝsika.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Den kaar kǝ tlyari wokociwo, ar ni babom kǝ zherju pal kǝ dǝ tǝ mom argon tu wu pi na wurpiyi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mbarǝm tu kan nǝm talanti nantamo, ar ni tǝ ter na talanti jen nantam esi, tǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, kǝ bim talanti nantam, ar tu a zam nantam rawi es deni.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Ar ni babom gǝs wul ti'e, &lt;Kǝ pi hoyi, zher mǝn ho pitǝne, mǝn aminci! Kǝ pi aminci den heli bar kan bi'i gwa. Aa ne'i den gam mbap na womti. Ɗir kǝ pi ghol mbatl na babom gi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mbarǝm tu bi ti talanti ropiyi ɗir pa'e, tǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, kǝ bim talanti rop, ar tu a zam talanti gucupi rop rawi deni.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Ar ni babomi nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;Kǝ pi hoyi, zher mǝn ho pitǝne, mǝn aminci! Kǝ pi aminci den wurpi njem kan bi'i gwa. Aa ne'i den gam mbap na womti. Ɗir kǝ pi ghol mbatl na babom gi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Ama nan mbarǝm tu kan nǝm talanti nǝmi ɗiro, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, a mom kǝ ban naari, kǝ rǝsh las tu kǝ ngani da gwa, ki mǝn ndu'i ci nguɓuk ni. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ar ni kem bǝrti ci mi, kan a ri bor shu gip atl a ghundǝr talanti gika. Shini nǝm bar gi!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Babomi nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;Ki zher mǝn ɗasi tu'e, mǝn la'are! Kǝ mom'e, a rǝsh ni las tu kan a ngani da'a, ami mǝn ndu'i ci nguɓuk ni.<verse eid="MAT 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Unun kem kǝ ri nem wurpi gǝn gip bom ba ne wurpi, ami ni a palo, a zam wurpiyi na mbǝli ra dene dawu? <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Ra untuwo, nǝm ni talanti nǝm tuka kar ti, kǝ bi ni muntu kan ra na talanti kutl ju gwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Domici muntu kan ra na baro, baa mbǝli ti ra kan tǝ zam ar nari. Muntu kan ra nari da ngapo, nye njem tu kan tǝra nari ma baa nǝmka. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />La ni wop zher tu te gip dun laska. Lasi ni baa kul na ngasi kur bi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tloyi mbarǝm shirǝm kǝ pa'i bisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Wokoci tu Nya mbarǝm baa sur gip nartǝn gǝsi, na mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam kupo, ti dǝm den dandi gǝs kǝ gun mǝn ɗǝɗatǝni. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Mbarǝm kǝ atl kup baa dom wur kar ti. Kan tǝ zǝzar mbarǝm na nǝm-nǝm gip ezǝni kandatu mǝn le dabba ba ɗǝli tǝmka gip mar gwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Kan tǝ pali tǝmi den am shimli gǝsi, mari ngapo den am yali gǝsi.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Wokociyi ni gunyi baa wul munju kan den am shimli gǝsi'e, &lt;Ɗir ni, kǝn kan Ban la'i in albarka gwa, kǝ nǝm ni gaado kǝ mulki tu Yam ne in terka na ne gǝs kǝ pi atl kundǝrǝndlip gwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Domici nan Ami ra den kumi guzumo, kǝ bim fingali. Nan ami ra den kumi guzum malo, kǝ bin mal tle. Nan ami ra mǝn dǝkiwo kǝ rim bom da ine. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Nan ami ra na tutul dli dawo, kǝ bim tutul dli. Nan ami ra den kumi dliwo, kǝ ga'ǝmi. Nan ami ra gip bom kǝ moniwo, kǝ ɗir kǝ shini gǝni.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Wokociyi ni mǝn pitǝn dlat ju ba nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;Babomi akoni mǝ shin ki den kumi guzum kan mǝ bi'i fingal we, ko ki den kumi guzum male kan mǝ bi'i mal tlewu? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Gigasi ni mǝ shin ki mǝn dǝkiyi, kan mǝ ri'i bom dami, ko kǝ den ndu'i tutul dli kan mǝ bi'i tutul dli kǝ la'iwu? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Eso gigasi ni mǝ shin ki den kumi dli ko gip bom kǝ moni kan mǝ ri kǝ shini giwe?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Gunyi baa nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, argon tu kup kǝ pi nǝm gip mir heli gip mir ɓyaro, ami ni kǝ pi mi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Kan tǝ wul munju den am yali gǝs gwa'e, &lt;Pǝtl kǝn ni ka namǝni, kǝn wop mbarǝme, teni gip utu tu kan baa mǝsh ka da'a, kan kǝrkǝmi Shetan na mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs gwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Domici nan ami ra den kumi guzumo, kǝ bim fingali da'a. Nan ami ra den kumi guzum malo, kǝ bim mal tle da'a. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nan ami ra mǝn dǝkiwo, kǝ rǝm bom da in da'a. Nan a hol tutul dliwo, kǝ bim tutul dli kǝ la'i da'a. Nan ami den kumi dli, kan ra gip bom kǝ moniwo, kǝ ɗir kǝ shini gǝn da'a.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Wii nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;Babomi, gigasi ni mǝ shin ki den kumi guzumi, ko kǝ den kumi guzum male, ko kira mǝn dǝki, ko kira na tutul dli da'a, ko kǝ den kumi dli, ko kira bom moni kan mǝ ne'i amra dawu?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Gunyi baa nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, argon tu kup kǝ nge pi nye heli gip mir ɓyaro, ami ni kǝ ngem pi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Munju ni baa te gip hukuntetǝn tu kan baa pa da gwa, ama mǝn pitǝn dlat ju ngapo gip ge mbatli kan baa pa da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Bali bi kǝ dǝ ri Yesu eka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mar 14.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luk 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Nan Yesu pa'i yari shirǝm ju kupo, ar ni tǝ wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ mom'e muri rop ni sa wi dǝ pi nyel jikat bǝdlabǝni, baa bi Nya Mbarǝm kǝdǝ ɓa tika den kini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ar ni kiri ga Liɓakǝ Yam, na kiri kǝ bǝn dom wur bom dǝ bari kǝ ga Liɓa kǝ Yami, mǝn sun'e Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Kan wu bali gip dlom gǝzǝn kǝdǝ wu nǝm Yesu mol wu ri ti eka. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ama ba'e wokoci kǝ nyel jikat bǝdlabǝn da'a, bǝse dǝ zam tli mbatl kar mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shoti Yesu mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Nan Yesu ra Betanya gip bom kǝ Simon muntu kan faro ba mǝn ndǝcci ni gwawo, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />ar ni nagǝr gon ɗir kar Yesu na mbun leti, laa'i na mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝri kan na wurpi nar gwa, kan tǝ shoti ti sur gam nan tǝra den ci fingal gwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ama nan mir mǝn kulci kar Yesu shin untuwo, ar ni lo ci wuri, kan wu ngwar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kem ti den li mir mǝn bar wurpika untuwe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Ar baa mani dǝ wur mirika na wurpi mǝn nartǝni, dǝ bi munju am ri wur kaar da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Nan Yesu mom damtǝn gǝzǝn kawo, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ ghun nagǝr tuwe? Mbuni bar ni tǝ pi mi. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Kii nǝra na munju kan am ri wur kaar da gwa ko gigasi, ama amiwo, kii nǝra namǝn ko gigasi da'a. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Tǝ shotim ni mir tu kǝ dǝ tǝ kǝrkǝm dli gǝn den bi kaptǝne. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, las tu kup baa pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm kǝ ci atl gam gip atl kundǝrǝndlipo, baa yari nagǝr tu den bi dami nan ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahuda nǝm'e tii bi Yesu ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10">Mar 14.10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Ar ni nǝm gip kutl-cet ropi, muntu ba wul ti'e Yahuda Iskaryoti ri kar kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kii bi mi, ami ni a bi in ti gwawe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu dlǝm wurpi zǝnariya hauya nǝm na kutl wu bi ti. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Den gas ta ni Yahuda Iskaryoti nǝm ngeni tǝp tu kan tii bi Yesu kagwa am dawuri.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ci fingal kǝ jikat bǝdlabǝn na mir mǝn kulci kar ti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Den pǝt kǝ pari kǝ nyel burodi tu kan na yisti dagwawo, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi ɗir kar ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ako ni kǝ ndu'e mǝ kǝrkǝmi'i Fingal Jikat bǝdlabǝni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Rǝni gip bǝni, ki zam mbarǝm goni, wul tǝ ni'e, &lt;Ba mǝn kulci wule, wokoci gǝn mbira wi kosak a ndu a ci nyel Jikat bǝdlabǝn na mir mǝn kulci karǝm gip bom gi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kartiyi pi kandatu tǝ yari wur gwa, kan wu kǝrkǝm fingal jikat bǝdlabǝni.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Nan sit piwo, ar ni Yesu dǝm kǝ dǝ tǝ ci fingali na mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl-cet ropi. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Nan wu den ci fingali wo, ar ni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, gon gip kǝn baa bimka am dǝ mǝn nge gǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ar ni ar ghun wur kan wu nǝm wuli gǝs na nǝm-nǝm, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ami ni da'a. Ko im Babomi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Ar ni tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan den si am gip gal nǝm namǝn gwa ni ba ri kǝ bi gǝn ka. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Nya mbarǝm ba mǝshka kandatu shirǝm kǝ Yam yari den ti tun terka gwa. Ama kashto kǝ muntu kan ba bi Nya mbarǝm ka gwa! Ar baa mani dǝ wule gǝr ti ni dama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Ar ni Yahuda kan bari kǝ bi Yesuyi ka wule,&lt;&lt;Ami na, Ba mǝn kulci?&gt;&gt;Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule,&lt;&lt;Kǝ yariwi na gam gi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ci fingal kǝ pa'i bisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luk 22.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Mkr 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Nan wu den ci fingalo, ar ni Yesu pǝn bǝredi kan tǝ goode Yami, tǝ cecceni, tǝ bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nǝm ni kǝ ci ni, muntuwo, dli gǝn ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Kan tǝ pǝn mal kin inabi gip wuro mal tǝ goode Yami, kan tǝ bi wur mal kin inabiyi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tla ni, kup gǝni. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Domici muntuwo bǝran gǝn ni, kǝ gudlum shirǝm kǝ Yam na mbarǝme, muntu kan ba ri kǝ shoti den bi ho'i warwat pitǝn kǝ mbarǝmka na womti gwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />A yari ine, aa i tla mal gǝri kin inabi tu da'a, se gas tu kan aa tla peli nan kǝn gip mulki kǝ Ban gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Nan wu wuli kono, ar ni wu to gǝzǝn den tlǝndǝr mǝn kin zaitun.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus baa wule tǝ mom Yesu da'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e,&lt;&lt;Gip gas kǝno kup gin kii kǝtǝr gin kǝ za'ǝmi, den bi kǝ argon tu bari kǝ zami gǝn gwa. Domici ar ra na rǝshi'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">&lt;Aa ɓo mǝn le tǝmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">kan dǝ tǝmi tatlka.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Ama den kaar kǝ tli gǝn gip mǝshi mbarǝmo, aa mbubar Galili cina da ine.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Ar ni Bitǝrus wule, &lt;&lt;Ko dǝ wule nami kup baa kǝtǝr gǝzǝn den bi kǝ argon tu bari kǝ zami giwo, amo aa pi untu da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ge shirǝm ni a yari'i, gip gas kǝni kapǝn dǝ tus kor la yaro, ki wule kǝ momǝn da'a bisi myakan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Ama Bitǝrus wule, &lt;&lt;Ko aa mǝsh ni nan ki, aa nge momi gika da'a.&gt;&gt; Ar ni nami mir mǝn kulci kar ti yari untu pa'e.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shǝrǝm na Yam su Getsemanika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ar ni Yesu na mir mǝn kulci kar ti ri las tu ba la bi'e, Getsemani gwa, kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝm ni bartu, naa to barta a shirǝm na Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Kan tǝ pǝn Bitǝrus na mimir kǝ Zabadi rop, ga Yakubu na Yohana, ar ni tǝ nǝm pi dun mbatl na ghuntǝn hoyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Dun mbatl tu kan ra gipǝno ar ba mani ri gǝn eka. Dlǝr ni bar tu kǝ dǝm ni gǝɗǝn namǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Nan tǝ te cina njemo, ar ni tǝ ngus atl den gamghurǝm tǝ shirǝm na Yami, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bǝba, ar ni ba piwo, pǝnim kumi dli tuka ngapi. Ama ba'e argon tu a ndu gwa ni kii pi da'a, se de argon tu kǝ ndu gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Kan tǝ pal ɗir kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti, tǝ zam wur den nde umuri. Ar ni tǝ wul Bitǝrus'e, &lt;&lt;O kii mani dǝmi gǝɗǝn kǝ awa nǝm na mǝn da'aya? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Dǝm ni gǝɗǝn kǝ shirǝm ni na Yami, bǝse kǝ nda ni ka gip godetǝne. Ruhu nǝm wi ama dli hol ndǝrtǝnka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Ar ni tǝ pa pal rǝnka kǝ ropi, tǝ shirǝm na Yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bǝba, ar ni baa pi dǝ pǝnǝm kumi dli tuka da'a se amin a tlawo, naa dǝ ndu'i gi pi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Nan tǝ pal ɗiro, ar ni tǝ pa zam wur wu den nde umuri, domici umur nǝm wur naar kawi. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ar ni tǝ za wuri, kan tǝ pa ndara kǝ shirǝm na Yam kǝ bisi myakan, tǝ den yari nǝm shirǝm tu kan tǝ yari far gwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Kan tǝ pal ɗir kar mir mǝn kulci kar ti, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ'i den umur na shukutǝna? Shin ni, wokoci pi wi nan baa bi Nya mbarǝmka am dǝ mǝn warwat pitǝn gwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Tli ni yam, mǝ ndara ni! Mǝn bi gǝn kan ta rawi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝmi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoh 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Ti gip shirǝm ituwi, ar ni Yahuda, nǝm gip mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl cet ropi, cwat na mbarǝm na womti, wu ra na ga tlyari sǝɓǝri, na ga dlo am da wuri. Kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam, na kiri kǝ bǝn ni kar wur ɗiri. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Tunka ni mǝn bi gǝs kayi yari wur'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu a pi ti sumbawo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sumbawo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Al'ada shirmitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda ni dǝ shirmi mbarǝmka na ɓopi gǝs kǝme.</char></note>, ti ni, nǝm tǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Na ɗirtǝn kǝ Yahuda kar Yesuwo, ar ni tǝ wul Yesuyi'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ shirmi'i ka, Mǝn kulci!&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ pi ti sumba.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Berǝm, da'i pi argon tu ɗir ki gwa.&gt;&gt; Kan mbarǝmi ba te cina, wu nǝm Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Na shini untuwo, ar ni nǝm gip munju kan ra na Yesuyi dli bar sǝɓǝr gǝs kan tǝ pati zher kǝ bari kǝ mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa kǝmka. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Pali bar sǝɓǝr gika gip kumti gǝsi. Domici kup muntu dlii bar sǝɓǝro, bar sǝɓǝr ni baa ri ti e. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Kǝ shin wule aa mani ni la'i bi Ban kan tǝ karim bar na mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs munju kan womtitǝn gǝzǝn man kǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn bi'utu zangu kutl cet rop (72,000) kǝkǝn tu da'aya? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ama ami ni a pi untuwo, imnu shirǝm kǝ Yam ba laa'i den'e untu ni ba pi na mǝn gwawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Wokociyi ni Yesu wul womti mbarǝmi'e,&lt;&lt;Ami mǝn tli mbarǝm mbatl gip bǝn na dlǝri den tǝp na, kan kǝ ɗir na ga tlyari sǝɓǝr na ga dlo kǝ dǝ kǝ nǝmǝn gwawe? A kur dǝm a kulci mbarǝm te gip Bom kǝ Yamka, ngapo kǝ nǝmǝn da'a. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ama kup muntu pini kǝ dǝ argon tu ga mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam rǝsh gip Shirǝm kǝ Yamo, ar laa'i.&gt;&gt; Na kumi untuwo, ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar Yesuyi kup za ti kan wu kǝtǝr gǝzǝni.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cina dǝ domtǝn kǝ mǝn Tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luk 22.54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Yoh 18.13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ar ni munju kan nǝm Yesuyi ri ti cina dǝ Kayafa, bari kǝ mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. Lasi ni mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa na kiri kǝ mǝn bǝn dom wuri kǝ tloyi shirǝmi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Ama Bitǝrus kop ti kaar nye pǝrsi-nye pǝrsiyi, wu mbubar dǝ bom dǝ kiri kǝ liɓa kǝ Yami. Tǝ te gipi tǝ dǝm atl na mǝn ɓuti bomi kǝ dǝ tǝ shin kandatu baa ndo gwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na domtǝn kǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝm kǝ mǝn Yahudayi kup, den ngeni seda kǝ lar den Yesu kǝdǝ wu zam tǝp kǝ ri gǝs eka. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Ama wu zam da'a, kup na mbarǝm na womti yari shirǝm kǝ lar den ti. Den kariwo, ar ni mbarǝm jen rop ɗiri, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu wule, &lt;Aa tatl bom kǝ Yam tuka, kan gip muri myakano a tu lasi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Ar ni bari kǝ mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam tlyami, kan tǝ wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Ki shirǝm diya? Unun kii yari den argon tu mbarǝm ju ba yari den ki gwawe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ama Yesu yon gǝsi. Ar ni bari kǝ mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;A ngash ki na Yam mǝn ge mbatli, yari mi, ki ni'e Almasihu Nya yama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Aan, kandatu kǝ yari gwa ni, ama a yari in ka, cina ɗewo, kii shin Nya mbarǝm njon den am shimli kǝ mǝn iko, tǝ den surtǝn gip dun yami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ar ni lo ci bari kǝ Liɓa kǝ Yam ju kan tǝ tlyati lulur gǝska, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ pi Yam mǝgǝn shirǝmwi! Seda unun mǝ'i ngeni? Kǝ kum mǝgǝn shirǝm tu kan tǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Unun kǝ shinu?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ndar mǝshtǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ar ni wu bǝse ti mo'ǝm den ba gere, kan wu ɓo ti. Jen ngapo wu la'i ti am kayama <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />kan wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e Almasihu fawo, pi mi anabci. Woni ɓo'iwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus nge momi Yesuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Wokociyiwo, Bitǝrus ra njon te gip dǝbomika, ar ni nye gǝr zher gon ɗir kar ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ki ma na Yesu ba mǝn Galili tu ni kira!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Ama Bitǝrus nge gǝs cina da wur kup, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A mom argon tu kǝ den shirǝm dene gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Nan Biturus ɗǝl ter tǝ te gip dlabǝno, ar ni nye gǝr gon mǝn pi mbap gip bomi shin ti, kan tǝ wul mbarǝm kan ra lasi gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu ma na Yesu kǝ Nazarat ni tǝ ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Ar ni Bitǝrus nge gǝs es na ɓe am atl tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A mom mbarǝm tu da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Den kaarika njemo, ar ni munju kan ra dlor lasi wul Bitǝrus'e, &lt;&lt;Untu ni, ki ma nǝm gip wur ni. Gǝs lǝka gi ni ɓul kika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ar ni tǝ nǝmi pi gam gǝs bi na ɓe am atl tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A mom mbarǝm tu da'a!&gt;&gt; Na yari untuwo, ar ni tus kor la yare. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Ar ni Bitǝrus dami argon tu Yesu yari ti gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Kapǝn dǝ tus kor la yaro, ki wule kǝ momǝn da'a bisi myakan.&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ ɗǝl te karika kan tǝ kul hoyi.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Ri Yesu cina dǝ Bilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk 23.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoh 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Nan bar tlo kǝ bi cigǝniwo, ar ni kiri ga Liɓa kǝ Yam na kiri kǝ bǝn kup mo bi kǝ dǝ wu ri Yesu eka. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ar ni wu ɓal tika, kan wu ri ta ti am dǝ Bilatus, gobna kǝ Roma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yahuda rat gam gǝska</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18">MMK 1.18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Nan Yahuda, muntu kan bi Yesu ka shin'e wu tloyi Yesu shirǝm kǝdǝ ri ti ekawo, ar ni tǝ pi dun mbatli, kan tǝ pal rǝnka kar kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kiri kǝ bǝni. Tǝ pali wur azurpa hauya nǝm na kutl gǝzǝni. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A pi warwat pitǝnwi, nan a bi muntu pi wani pitǝn da'a dǝ ri ti eka gwa.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun ghun mi? Muntuwo, damtǝn gi ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Ar ni Yahuda wi wurpiyika te gip Bom kǝ Yamka, kan tǝ ɗǝl tǝ ri rat gam gǝska. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Ar ni kiri ga Liɓa kǝ Yam yem wurpiyi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ndari dǝ ne wurpiyi kǝba ne wurpi kǝ Bom kǝ Yam da'a, nan wurpi bǝran ni gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ar ni wu mo bi kan wu wur las gon na wurpiyi. Ba la bi lasi'e las kǝ mǝn tu'i tati, kǝdǝ lasi dǝm ba kapi mǝn dǝki. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ar ni kem ba la bi lasi'e, Las kǝ Bǝran har sekǝni.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Tǝp untuni laa'i argon tu mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Irmiya yari gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Wu pǝn azurpa hauya nǝm na kutli, wurpi tu kan mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila mo bi den dǝ ɓatl den ti gwa itu. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Kan wu wur las kǝ mǝn tu'i tat nari, kandatu Babom wulǝm ra gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cina dǝ Bilatus gobna kǝ Roma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoh 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu ra dlor cina dǝ gobna kǝ Romayi ituwi, ar ni gunyi ngen momi kar ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e gun kǝ mǝn Yahudaya?&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Aan, kandatu kǝ yari gwani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ama nan kiri ga liɓa kǝ Yam na kiri kǝ bǝn ne ti lar gamo, tǝ shirǝm da'a. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ar ni Bilatus wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ kum ni shirǝm ju wu yari den ki gwa diya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ama Yesu bali ti shirǝm ko nǝm da'a, kan ar ba dlǝkǝn gobnayi hoyi.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tloyi Yesu shǝrǝm kǝ mǝshtǝni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-26">Luk 23.13-26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Wokoci nyel jǝkat bǝdlabǝno, gobnayi ba kur pǝtli wur mbarǝm nǝm gip munju kan ra na ɓali gip bom moni, muntu wu ndu gwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Wokociyiwo, bar mǝn tli bǝn mbatl gon kan mbarǝm mom ti hoyi gwa ra gip bom moni mǝn sun'e Barabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Nan womti mbarǝmi dom wuro, ar ni Bilatus ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Woni kǝ ndu'e a pǝtli in we, Barabas na, ko Yesu muntu ba la ti bi'e Almasihu gwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Domici Bilatus mom'e ghuve ni kem wur kǝ bi Yesu ka. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Nan Bilatus dǝm den dandi tloyi shirǝm gǝso, ar ni nagǝr gǝs kar bar na shirǝm tu dǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗǝl ka gip tǝp kǝ mbarǝm tu kan ra na wani pitǝn da gwa, domici a kum dli naar gip tlon den ti gip gasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ama kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kiri kǝ bǝn co mbarǝm kǝ dǝ wu wule, dǝ pǝtli wur Barabas, kan Yesuwo, dǝ ri ti eka. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Gobna kǝ Romayi ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Gonge ni gip rop ju kǝ ndu'e a pǝtli inwe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Barabas!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Kan Bilatus ba ngen momi kar wur es tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun aa pi na Yesu muntu ba la ti bi'e, Almasihu gwawe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu tli yar kup gǝzǝn wu wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ ɓa tika den kini!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Bilatus pa ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun kemi? Unu wani pitǝn ni tǝ piwe?&gt;&gt; Ama womti mbarǝmi wom bar ra wu wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ ɓa tika den kini!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Nan Bilatus shin ti'i mani pi argon da'a, mbarǝm es den ndu'i tli mbatl naar kawo, ar ni tǝ nge mal kan tǝ ho am gǝska cina da wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Pun ni am gǝn ra gip shoti bǝran kǝ mbarǝm tu. Muntuwo ge gin ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Ar ni mbarǝmi kup nǝm wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Naa dǝ bǝran gǝs dǝm den gam gǝmi na mimir gǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Kan tǝ pǝtli wur Barabas. Tǝ bi bi dǝ ɓo Yesu, kan dǝ ɓa tika den kini.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn bi'utu lo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-21">Mar 15.16-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Yoh 19.2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ar ni mǝn bi'utu kǝ gobna te na Yesu gip bom kǝ gobna kǝ Romayi, kan wu la bi domtǝn kǝ mǝn bi'utu kup wu gandǝl tika. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Wu tusi ti tutul dli gǝs ka, kan wu la'i ti zili tlyari luluri. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Ar ni wu pi ti lish kǝ gun ka ire, wu kemi ti sur gami. Kan wu kem tǝ nǝm dlo na am gǝs kǝ shimli, wu ngus cina da ti, wu wuli ti den kaar bi'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ shirmi'ika ra, gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Wu bǝse ti mo'ǝmi kan wu nǝm dloyi wu pi ta ɓe gǝs den gami. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Nan wu pa'i lo'i gǝso, ar ni wu tusi ti zili tlyari luluri ka, kan wu la'i ti gwasi. Ar ni wu ndara nan ti kǝ dǝ wu ɓa tika den kini.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓa Yesuka den kini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:22-32">Mar 15.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:27-43">Luk 23.27-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Nan wu den ritǝno, ar ni wu mo na mbarǝm kǝ Sairin gon mǝn sun Siman, wu kem ti tǝ pǝn kin kǝ ɓa'i Yesuyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Wu ri las tu ba la bi'e, Golgota gwa (Ba kula gam ituwi). <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Kan wu bi ti mal gǝri kin inabi nan kurtli na ɗasi bar gon gwa, kǝ dǝ tǝ tla. Ama nan tǝ la lǝka denewo, ar ni tǝ nge tleka. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Nan wu ɓa ti den kiniwo, ar ni wu rabe lulur gǝs tǝp kǝ ba la'i guri'a. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, ar ni wu dǝm lasi wu den ne ger den ti. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />To gami da ti kawo, ar ni wu rǝsh shirǝm den ar gontu tǝpi wani gwa, MUNTU NI'E YESU, GUN KƏ MƏN YAHUDA. <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Mur mǝn tare tǝp jen ra rop kan ɓa wur den kin nan ti gwa, gon den am shimli, gon ngapo den am yali gǝsi. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Mbarǝm ju ba wushe ma wu nǝmi ti pi mǝgǝn shirǝmi, wu den kungǝt gami. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ki kan kǝ wule, ki yasi bom kǝ Yamka, kan kǝ tu gip muri myakan. O ki Nya Yam ni fawo, ɗǝli gam gi, kǝ ɗǝl ka sur den kin tu kan ɓa ki gwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Untuni es kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yami, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm den tǝlankur Kulci kǝ Musa na kiri kǝ bǝn lo ti. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ɗǝli jeni, ama tǝ mbu ɗǝli gam gǝs da'a! Ti ni'e gun kǝ mǝn Isra'ila! Naa tǝ ɗǝl sur den kin tu kan ɓa ti gwa kan mǝ ngǝsh mi den ti. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Tǝ ne mbatl den Yami. Naa dǝ Yami ɗǝli ti kǝkǝni, tin tǝ ndu ti gwa, domici tǝ wule, &lt;Ami Nya Yam ni.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Untuni es mur mǝn tare guntǝp ju kan ɓa wur den kin nan ti gwa pi ti mǝgǝn shirǝmi.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ar ni dǝmǝn nga las ka kup, gip dlom pǝte, ar ba ri gǝlla am myakan kǝ siti. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Bar kǝ gǝlla am myakan kǝ sitiwo, ar ni Yesu tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani?&gt;&gt; Mun tu ni'e, &lt;&lt;Yam gǝni, Yam gǝni, unun kem kǝ balim karwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Nan jen kan ra dlor lasi kum untuwo, ar ni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ den la'i bi Iliya wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ar ni nǝm gip wur na zhotǝn kǝtǝr tǝ pǝn soso tǝ gi na mati mal inabi, tǝ ɓal den dlo tǝ ta'i Yesu kǝ dǝ tǝ tla. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Kan nami mbarǝmi ba wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno za ti ni, naa mǝ shin ko Iliyayi baa sur ɗǝli ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Nan Yesu tli yar yam eso, ar ni tǝ kotl mbatlka.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Gip wokociyi ni labǝle kǝ gip Bom kǝ Yam tlyatka gip dlom sur gami ar su atli. Kan atl ba jirkǝt ti, ga sǝla ba tatlka. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Kan ga gambǝci ba ɓulka, dli kǝ mbarǝm kǝ Yam na womti kan mǝsh ka baa tli na rai. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Wu ɗǝl ka gip gambǝci gǝzǝni, den kaar kǝ tlitǝn kǝ Yesu gip mǝshi mbarǝmo, kan wu te gip Bǝn kan ra dlǝran gwa, wu ɗǝl kar mbarǝm na womti. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Nan bari kǝ mǝn bi'utu na munju kan den ɓuti Yesuyi shin jirkǝttǝn kǝ atli na bar ju kan pi kupo, ar ni bǝrti nǝm wur kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi, mbarǝm tuwo, Nya Yam ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Mǝtli jen ra na womti njeen kan den shini bar ju den pitǝn gwa. Wu kop ni Yesu ter Galili kǝ dǝ wu ne ti am ra. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Gip mǝtliyiwo, ga Maryamu kǝ Magadala, na Maryamu nasi ga Yakubu na Isubu, na nasi mimir kǝ Zabadi ra.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kapi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Nan sit piwo, ar ni ba mǝn wurpi gon kǝ Arimatiya mǝn sun'e Isubu ɗiri, ti ma nye mǝn kulci kar Yesu ni. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Tǝ te kar Bilatus tǝ liri dli kǝ Yesu, ar ni Bilatus bi bi den'e dǝ bi ti. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Ar ni Isubu pǝn dliyi kan tǝ ghumka na pel ghol tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝme, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />kan tǝ la dliyi gip pel gambǝci gǝs kan tǝ mbun den tu sǝla gwa. Tǝ kutǝl bar tat kan tǝ le bi gambǝci'ika na ri kan tǝ ndara. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maryamu kǝ Magadala na Maryamuyi mǝn nǝm ra njon cina dǝ bi gambǝci'i.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn ne ger den gambǝci'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Nan bar tlo den pǝt shukutǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudawo, ar ni kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na mǝn me gam kǝ Parise ri kar Bilatus. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Wu wul ti'e &lt;&lt;Dǝ Yam za ki ra, mǝ dami wi'e wokoci tu mǝn ceni lar tu ra na ge mbatlo, tǝ wule, &lt;Den kaar kǝ muri myakano, Aa tli na ge mbatl esi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ra'untuwo, bi bi kǝ dǝ ri ɓut gambǝci'i ar ri muri myakan. Dǝ pi untu bise dǝ mir mǝn kulci kar ti pi mur kǝ dli gǝska kan wu yari mbarǝm'e, tǝ tli ni ka gip mǝshi mbarǝme, kan dǝ setǝn kǝ kǝkǝn man kǝ pariyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Bilatus wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Yem ni mǝn bi utu kǝ ri ne ni ger den gambǝci'i kandatu kii mani gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ar ni wu ri ɓut gambǝci'i tǝp kǝ ba ɓe am kǝ gunyi den tat tu le gambǝci'i ka nari gwa, kan wu pa wi mǝn bi utu kǝ dǝ wu ɓuti.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Tlitǝn kǝ Yesu gip mǝshi mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Bar tlo kǝ bǝtloni den kaar kǝ pǝt shukutǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda, den pǝt kǝ nǝm kǝ sati, ar ni Maryamu kǝ Magadala na Maryamu mǝn nǝmi, ri kǝ shini gambǝci'i. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Wule gip njipkǝr gere ar ni atl jirkǝt ti, kan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon ba ɗǝl sur yam tǝ kutǝl tat kan le bi gambǝci'ika nari gwa, tǝ dǝm gǝs deni. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Tǝ den cirtǝn wule ci bi kǝ Yami, tutul dli gǝs es ra gholi puun wule auduga. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Ar ni bǝrti ci mǝn ɓuti gam biciˈi den mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami, wu zhizhim wur kan wu nda atlka wule mǝshi mbarǝme. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Ama mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami wul mǝtliyi'e, &lt;&lt;Ba dǝ bǝrti ci in ni ka da'a, a mom'e kǝn ni den ngeni Yesu kan ɓa tika den kin gwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Tǝ ra ɗe da'a, tǝ tli gǝs gip mǝshi mbarǝmka wi kandatu tǝ yari gwa. Ɗir shin ni las tu kap ti gwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Rǝ ni ka na zhotǝne, kǝ yari ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;Tǝ tli gip mǝshi mbarǝmka wi. Tii mbubar atl kǝ Galili cina da ine. Barta ni ki shin ti.&gt; Ar gon tu a ɗir kǝ dǝ a yari in gwa itu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ar ni mǝtliyi za gambǝci'i na zhotǝn gip bǝrti, ama laa'i na ghol mbatli wu kǝtǝr kǝ dǝ wu ri yari mir mǝn kulci kar ti. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Wule gip njipkǝr gere ar ni Yesu mo nan wur kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A shirmi in ka.&gt;&gt; Ar ni wu ngus kan wu nǝm asǝm gǝs wu bote ti.<verse eid="MAT 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba dǝ bǝrti ci inni ka da'a. Ri yari ni mir ɓyar wu te gip atl kǝ Galili, bar ta ni wu shimǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn ɓuti gam bǝci'i yar argon tu kan pi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Nan mǝtliyi den tǝp ndaratǝno, ar ni jen gip mǝn bi'utu mǝn ɓuti gambǝci'i te gip bǝn kǝ dǝ wu yari kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam bar ju kup pi gwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Ar ni kiri Liɓa kǝ Yam na kiri kǝ bǝni mo gam wu dar bi, kan wu bi mǝn bi'utuyi wurpi mǝn nartǝni, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />wu wul ga mǝn bi'utuyi'e, &lt;&lt;Wul ni'e, mir mǝn kulci kar ti ni ɗir kǝ gas kan wu pi mur kǝ dli gǝska nan mǝn den nde umur gwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Shirǝm tu ni ri kǝm dǝ gobna kǝ Romawo, mi mom ar gon tu mi yari ti kan baa kem tii hukunte'in dagwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Ar ni mǝn bi'utuyi nǝm wurpiyi wu pi kandatu wul wur'e dǝ wu pi gwa. Shirǝm tuwo har sekǝn mbarǝm kǝ Yahuda ba pi shirǝm deni.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbap tu Yesu bi mir mǝn kulci kar ti gwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">MMK 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Ar ni mir mǝn kulci kar ti kutl-cet nǝmi te gip Galili, wu to den tlǝndǝr tu kan Yesu yari wur'e wii mo gwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Nan wu shin ti wo, ar ni wu ngusi ti, ama jen gǝzǝn cen mbatl ka. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Ar ni Yesu ɗir kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Iko kǝ to yamka na kǝ den atlo kup bim kawi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Ra'untuwo, rii pi ni mbarǝm kǝ atl kup wazu, kǝ pi wur ni batisma gip sun kǝ Bǝba, na kǝ Nya, na kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yami, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />kǝ pa kulci wur ni wu kop kup argon tu a yari in kǝ pi gwa. Na ho bi, ami ra nan kǝn ko gigasi, ar ri patǝn kǝ zhan kup.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>